1
00:00:20,166 --> 00:00:26,041
<font size="20">Kasus dingin ini terjadi
pada malam tanggal 11 Mei 1973.</font>

2
00:00:27,125 --> 00:00:32,333
<font size="20">Sekitar pukul 00.48
di kawasan Brick Lane, London Timur,</font>

3
00:00:32,416 --> 00:00:34,666
<font size="20">seorang pria berjalan pulang dari pub</font>

4
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:37,666
<font size="20">menuju rumah kekasihnya, Angela Hughes.</font>

5
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:41,750
<font size="20">Tiba-tiba ia mendengar
dua orang bergumul di lantai dua.</font>

6
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:52,708
<font size="20">Berhenti! Kau!</font>

7
00:00:54,541 --> 00:00:55,583
<font size="20">Berhenti!</font>

8
00:01:00,458 --> 00:01:04,291
<font size="20">Ketika polisi tiba,
Angela Hughes sudah tak bernyawa.</font>

9
00:01:05,041 --> 00:01:08,208
<font size="20">Setelah ditelusuri, tak ada yang dicuri.</font>

10
00:01:08,291 --> 00:01:09,625
<font size="20">Itu janggal.</font>

11
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,541
<font size="20">Apa yang janggal, Ron?</font>

12
00:01:11,625 --> 00:01:16,166
<font size="20">Apa motifnya? Aneh merampok
pasangan muda yang tak punya apa-apa.</font>

13
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:17,208
<font size="20">Itu masuk akal.</font>

14
00:01:17,291 --> 00:01:20,416
<font size="20">Artinya, satu-satunya orang</font>

15
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:23,916
<font size="20">yang melihat pelaku bertopeng
hanya kekasihnya?</font>

16
00:01:24,625 --> 00:01:28,333
<font size="20">- Menurut laporan polisi, benar.
- Siapa kekasihnya?</font>

17
00:01:29,791 --> 00:01:30,791
<font size="20">Namanya?</font>

18
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:35,708
<font size="20">Peter Mercer, 25 tahun. Mekanik.</font>

19
00:01:35,791 --> 00:01:39,708
<font size="20">Dibebastugaskan dari militer
karena luka tembak di lutut.</font>

20
00:01:39,791 --> 00:01:41,750
<font size="20">Mungkin ada trauma belum selesai.</font>

21
00:01:41,833 --> 00:01:43,791
<font size="20">Memang memicu perilaku labil.</font>

22
00:01:43,875 --> 00:01:46,625
<font size="20">Mercer mengejar pelaku, tapi gagal.</font>

23
00:01:46,708 --> 00:01:50,583
<font size="20">Tak lama setelahnya,
Mercer lenyap tanpa jejak.</font>

24
00:01:50,666 --> 00:01:54,208
<font size="20">Nah, 'kan? Janggal.
Ada bau-bau busuk rekayasa.</font>

25
00:01:54,708 --> 00:01:57,916
<font size="20">Apa korbannya punya peluang selamat?</font>

26
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,625
<font size="20">Sulit dipastikan.</font>

27
00:01:59,708 --> 00:02:03,666
<font size="20">Menurut laporan, dia tewas
akibat luka tusuk, bukan jatuh.</font>

28
00:02:03,750 --> 00:02:04,916
<font size="20">Jelas pembunuhan.</font>

29
00:02:05,958 --> 00:02:08,666
<font size="20">Mercer seharusnya paham P3K dasar.</font>

30
00:02:08,750 --> 00:02:11,291
<font size="20">Kenapa tak menolong pacarnya? Konyol.</font>

31
00:02:11,375 --> 00:02:15,708
<font size="20">Dia bersaksi Angela tewas seketika,
padahal perdarahan tak secepat itu.</font>

32
00:02:16,791 --> 00:02:18,208
<font size="20">Jujur, aku bingung.</font>

33
00:02:18,291 --> 00:02:20,500
<font size="20">- Bingung?
- Kasus ini rumit.</font>

34
00:02:20,583 --> 00:02:24,083
<font size="20">Kasus mayat mutilasi
di kotak pos saja tak serumit ini.</font>

35
00:02:24,166 --> 00:02:28,291
<font size="20">Ya. Sekarang kita butuh
seorang ahli medis.</font>

36
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:51,625
<font size="20">Ini Coopers Chase yang terkenal itu?</font>

37
00:02:52,125 --> 00:02:53,333
<font size="20">Mari berkeliling.</font>

38
00:02:53,416 --> 00:02:58,291
<font size="20">Di sana ada hospice untuk lansia
di penghujung… Kau tahulah.</font>

39
00:02:58,375 --> 00:03:00,125
<font size="20">Ada kelas panahan.</font>

40
00:03:00,208 --> 00:03:03,875
<font size="20">Malah ada warga peraih medali perak
saat Olimpiade 1972.</font>

41
00:03:04,750 --> 00:03:08,750
<font size="20">Bagus! Hebat. Ya, begitu.</font>

42
00:03:08,833 --> 00:03:11,625
<font size="20">Akuilah, Joanna, hunian ini indah.</font>

43
00:03:12,208 --> 00:03:15,083
<font size="20">Bahkan ada llama untuk terapi.</font>

44
00:03:15,166 --> 00:03:17,125
<font size="20">Llama memang sudah pasaran, Bu.</font>

45
00:03:17,625 --> 00:03:18,791
<font size="20">- Oh.
- Hati-hati.</font>

46
00:03:18,875 --> 00:03:23,416
<font size="20">Llama itu sangat temperamental.
Kadang menggigit, kadang meludah.</font>

47
00:03:25,166 --> 00:03:28,916
<font size="20">Manusia juga begitu kalau stres berat.</font>

48
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,333
<font size="20">Ibu mau menunjukkan ruang teka-teki.</font>

49
00:03:31,916 --> 00:03:35,125
<font size="20">Dia tewas kehabisan darah
karena luka tusuk atau jatuh?</font>

50
00:03:35,208 --> 00:03:36,333
<font size="20">Ya ampun.</font>

51
00:03:38,333 --> 00:03:39,333
<font size="20">Halo.</font>

52
00:03:40,583 --> 00:03:43,000
<font size="20">Bukannya ini ruang teka-teki?</font>

53
00:03:43,083 --> 00:03:44,916
<font size="20">Kecuali hari Kamis.</font>

54
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,125
<font size="20">Baik. Maaf.</font>

55
00:03:52,875 --> 00:03:54,208
<font size="20">Silakan dilanjut.</font>

56
00:03:55,916 --> 00:03:56,750
<font size="20">Bu?</font>

57
00:04:00,125 --> 00:04:02,875
<font size="20">Pasti klub penggemar Agatha Christie
atau semacamnya.</font>

58
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,458
<font size="20">Aku harus pergi lagi.</font>

59
00:04:08,541 --> 00:04:12,083
<font size="20">Macetnya parah,
padahal ada janji ke opera dengan klien.</font>

60
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:14,000
<font size="20">Bu.</font>

61
00:04:14,083 --> 00:04:16,500
<font size="20">- Menurutku keliru Ibu tinggal di sini.
- Apa?</font>

62
00:04:16,583 --> 00:04:18,708
<font size="20">Kubelikan flat di dekat rumahku, ya?</font>

63
00:04:18,791 --> 00:04:20,375
<font size="20">Agak dekat.</font>

64
00:04:21,083 --> 00:04:25,916
<font size="20">Joanna, Ibu ingin tinggal
di tempat yang banyak temannya.</font>

65
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,958
<font size="20">Mana bisa Ibu mencari teman di Hackney</font>

66
00:04:29,041 --> 00:04:33,708
<font size="20">yang dikelilingi anak hipster
dan toko roti vegan?</font>

67
00:04:34,333 --> 00:04:37,541
<font size="20">- Siapa yang mau menemani nenek-nenek?
- Ya sudah.</font>

68
00:04:38,875 --> 00:04:40,791
<font size="20">Aku cuma ingin Ibu bahagia lagi.</font>

69
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:42,625
<font size="20">Sejak Ayah tiada…</font>

70
00:04:43,250 --> 00:04:46,000
<font size="20">- Intinya, aku cemas.
- Ibu baik-baik saja.</font>

71
00:04:50,708 --> 00:04:52,458
<font size="20">- Hati-hati di jalan.
- Pasti.</font>

72
00:04:54,291 --> 00:04:56,541
<font size="20">Semoga aku tak salah langkah, Gerry.</font>

73
00:04:57,041 --> 00:04:59,750
<font size="20">Belum terbiasa mengambil
keputusan besar sendiri.</font>

74
00:05:01,125 --> 00:05:04,958
<font size="20">Selamat ulang tahun</font>

75
00:05:05,041 --> 00:05:07,291
<font size="20">Selamat ulang tahun…</font>

76
00:05:07,375 --> 00:05:08,833
<font size="20">Oh, dia di sana.</font>

77
00:05:08,916 --> 00:05:10,375
<font size="20">Selamat ulang tahun…</font>

78
00:05:10,458 --> 00:05:12,833
<font size="20">- Bukan.
- Pasti di sini angka dua.</font>

79
00:05:12,916 --> 00:05:15,333
<font size="20">- Kau perawat?
- Maaf, apa?</font>

80
00:05:15,416 --> 00:05:18,166
<font size="20">Tadi kau tidak bereaksi
melihat foto-foto TKP.</font>

81
00:05:18,250 --> 00:05:20,750
<font size="20">Siapa tahu pernah
menjadi tenaga kesehatan.</font>

82
00:05:20,833 --> 00:05:22,083
<font size="20">Bisa juga dokter,</font>

83
00:05:22,166 --> 00:05:25,166
<font size="20">tapi zaman dulu dokter perempuan
bisa dihitung jari.</font>

84
00:05:25,250 --> 00:05:28,666
<font size="20">Jadi, kau pasti perawat trauma
yang sering melihat luka fatal.</font>

85
00:05:29,166 --> 00:05:30,083
<font size="20">Benar, tidak?</font>

86
00:05:30,166 --> 00:05:31,958
<font size="20">Tepat sekali.</font>

87
00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:35,083
<font size="20">Maaf, aku Elizabeth.</font>

88
00:05:35,166 --> 00:05:36,000
<font size="20">Ibrahim.</font>

89
00:05:37,333 --> 00:05:38,375
<font size="20">Ron.</font>

90
00:05:38,958 --> 00:05:40,583
<font size="20">- Aku Joyce.
- Joyce.</font>

91
00:05:40,666 --> 00:05:43,583
<font size="20">Joyce, bisa periksa ini sebentar?</font>

92
00:05:45,541 --> 00:05:47,125
<font size="20">Ya Tuhan.</font>

93
00:05:47,833 --> 00:05:50,833
<font size="20">Penjelasan detailnya bisa nanti.</font>

94
00:05:50,916 --> 00:05:54,041
<font size="20">Bisakah gadis itu selamat
dengan luka begitu?</font>

95
00:05:54,791 --> 00:05:58,083
<font size="20">Tergantung berat badannya juga.</font>

96
00:05:58,708 --> 00:06:00,041
<font size="20">Perdarahannya hebat.</font>

97
00:06:00,125 --> 00:06:01,791
<font size="20">Beratnya 46 kg.</font>

98
00:06:01,875 --> 00:06:05,208
<font size="20">Kalau begitu, mungkin bisa selamat asal…</font>

99
00:06:05,291 --> 00:06:08,875
<font size="20">Maaf, sampai kapan kalian gaduh di sini?</font>

100
00:06:08,958 --> 00:06:11,583
<font size="20">Kami mau menyelesaikan
Sudoku level tersulit.</font>

101
00:06:11,666 --> 00:06:15,291
<font size="20">Joyce, bisa ikut kami
untuk berbincang lebih lanjut?</font>

102
00:06:15,791 --> 00:06:16,833
<font size="20">Di tempat sepi.</font>

103
00:06:16,916 --> 00:06:18,375
<font size="20">Boleh saja.</font>

104
00:06:19,166 --> 00:06:20,083
<font size="20">Kalian siapa?</font>

105
00:06:20,166 --> 00:06:21,791
<font size="20">Maaf, belum berkenalan.</font>

106
00:06:22,708 --> 00:06:24,541
<font size="20">Kami Thursday Murder Club.</font>

107
00:06:35,875 --> 00:06:37,250
<font size="20">Beri kabar baik, Lloyd.</font>

108
00:06:37,333 --> 00:06:39,916
<font size="20">Bayaranmu mahal,
jangan sampai aku buntung.</font>

109
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,791
<font size="20">Selamat pagi, Ian.
Berikut kabar terbarunya.</font>

110
00:06:42,875 --> 00:06:46,041
<font size="20">Istrimu menuntut mobil, rumah,</font>

111
00:06:46,125 --> 00:06:48,250
<font size="20">serta apartemen di Mayorka.</font>

112
00:06:48,333 --> 00:06:52,875
<font size="20">Aku cuma selingkuh sekali!
Keterlaluan tuntutannya!</font>

113
00:06:53,458 --> 00:06:57,166
<font size="20">Padahal dia tak sesuci itu.
Ada buktinya. Bisa untuk melawan.</font>

114
00:06:57,250 --> 00:07:00,250
<font size="20">Keterlaluan atau tidak,
kau harus bersiap, Ian.</font>

115
00:07:00,333 --> 00:07:02,291
<font size="20">Gemma serius ingin bercerai</font>

116
00:07:02,375 --> 00:07:04,791
<font size="20">dan akan menggugat hartamu habis-habisan.</font>

117
00:07:20,666 --> 00:07:22,041
<font size="20">- Hei.
- Ian.</font>

118
00:07:27,708 --> 00:07:32,416
<font size="20">Jadi, kenapa ini mendesak?
Kenapa bertemu diam-diam?</font>

119
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:35,166
<font size="20">Aku harus segera memaksimalkan asetku.</font>

120
00:07:35,250 --> 00:07:38,291
<font size="20">Penggusuran makam harus berjalan
meski tanpa izin.</font>

121
00:07:38,375 --> 00:07:41,666
<font size="20">Lebih mudah minta maaf
daripada minta izin, 'kan?</font>

122
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:44,708
<font size="20">Kita bongkar gereja,
lalu bangun apartemen mewah.</font>

123
00:07:45,500 --> 00:07:49,083
<font size="20">Aduh, sulit. Lansia di sana?
Mereka pasti keberatan.</font>

124
00:07:49,166 --> 00:07:53,500
<font size="20">Biar saja. Nanti juga tergusur.
Bangunannya jadi gedung serbaguna.</font>

125
00:07:53,583 --> 00:07:55,208
<font size="20">Mereka pasti melawan.</font>

126
00:07:55,291 --> 00:07:59,083
<font size="20">Banyak yang pernah
jadi orang besar di masanya.</font>

127
00:07:59,166 --> 00:08:01,250
<font size="20">Itu dulu. Sekarang ini masaku.</font>

128
00:08:01,333 --> 00:08:02,583
<font size="20">Itu tanahku.</font>

129
00:08:03,333 --> 00:08:06,583
<font size="20">Masa bodoh dengan para fosil rewel itu.</font>

130
00:08:07,208 --> 00:08:10,291
<font size="20">Yang sungguh menghambat
justru Tony Curran.</font>

131
00:08:12,125 --> 00:08:12,958
<font size="20">Kenapa?</font>

132
00:08:16,083 --> 00:08:18,916
<font size="20">- Silakan, Pak Ventham.
- Terima kasih.</font>

133
00:08:20,333 --> 00:08:24,125
<font size="20">Tony punya saham di Coopers Chase.
Pasti kebagian untung, 'kan?</font>

134
00:08:24,208 --> 00:08:27,541
<font size="20">Ya, itu kalau dia setuju proyek ini,
tapi dia menentang.</font>

135
00:08:27,625 --> 00:08:30,541
<font size="20">Bibinya warga kompleks.
Tony tak mau dia terusik.</font>

136
00:08:30,625 --> 00:08:32,916
<font size="20">Jika Tony tak mau, siapa yang urus?</font>

137
00:08:37,041 --> 00:08:37,916
<font size="20">Aku?</font>

138
00:08:38,625 --> 00:08:41,875
<font size="20">Tertarik? Jadi mandor? Dapat untung besar?</font>

139
00:08:43,625 --> 00:08:45,750
<font size="20">Ya, bolehlah.</font>

140
00:08:46,375 --> 00:08:48,166
<font size="20">Aku justru terbantu.</font>

141
00:08:48,250 --> 00:08:50,125
<font size="20">Ibuku sakit keras di Polandia,</font>

142
00:08:50,208 --> 00:08:54,083
<font size="20">jadi aku harus mengirim
uang pengobatan, tapi…</font>

143
00:08:54,166 --> 00:08:57,166
<font size="20">Bogdan, alat berat
sudah dipesan untuk Senin pagi.</font>

144
00:08:57,250 --> 00:09:01,625
<font size="20">Kau tinggal datang ke pemakaman,
mulai gali, lalu terima uang.</font>

145
00:09:02,208 --> 00:09:05,583
<font size="20">Sangat cukup
untuk membantu ibumu di Rumania.</font>

146
00:09:05,666 --> 00:09:07,666
<font size="20">- Polandia.
- Polandia. Terserah.</font>

147
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:12,458
<font size="20">Tony Curran berbahaya.
Dia orang dari dunia hitam.</font>

148
00:09:13,166 --> 00:09:14,416
<font size="20">Kalau kau pecat,</font>

149
00:09:16,083 --> 00:09:17,083
<font size="20">kau bisa dibunuh.</font>

150
00:09:18,333 --> 00:09:19,333
<font size="20">Bogdan,</font>

151
00:09:20,458 --> 00:09:23,125
<font size="20">aku ini petarung MMA veteran, jelas?</font>

152
00:09:23,208 --> 00:09:24,333
<font size="20">Tingkat regional.</font>

153
00:09:24,416 --> 00:09:27,041
<font size="20">Ya, aku sendiri berbahaya.</font>

154
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:31,291
<font size="20">Jadi, sepakat atau tidak?</font>

155
00:09:33,125 --> 00:09:35,041
<font size="20">Baiklah, aku mau.</font>

156
00:09:35,125 --> 00:09:36,875
<font size="20">- Sepakat.
- Bagus.</font>

157
00:09:37,458 --> 00:09:39,250
<font size="20">Selamat pagi, Bibi Maud.</font>

158
00:09:39,750 --> 00:09:41,333
<font size="20">Kesukaanku!</font>

159
00:09:41,416 --> 00:09:43,083
<font size="20">Bibi cantik sekali hari ini.</font>

160
00:09:43,166 --> 00:09:44,833
<font size="20">Kau baik sekali, Tone.</font>

161
00:09:44,916 --> 00:09:48,416
<font size="20">- Pagi, Tony. Halo. Apa kabar?
- Ron. Pagi.</font>

162
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:51,291
<font size="20">Kenalkan, ini Joyce. Dia baru masuk.</font>

163
00:09:51,375 --> 00:09:53,416
<font size="20">- Selamat datang.
- Terima kasih.</font>

164
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:54,750
<font size="20">Pagi, Maud.</font>

165
00:09:57,541 --> 00:09:58,500
<font size="20">Siapa itu?</font>

166
00:09:58,583 --> 00:10:01,958
<font size="20">Tony Curran, pemilik Coopers Chase
bersama Ian Ventham.</font>

167
00:10:02,041 --> 00:10:04,958
<font size="20">Biara reyot ini dibeli Tony tahun 1980-an.</font>

168
00:10:05,041 --> 00:10:06,541
<font size="20">Dapat harga murah juga.</font>

169
00:10:06,625 --> 00:10:07,750
<font size="20">Ya, memang murah.</font>

170
00:10:07,833 --> 00:10:11,458
<font size="20">Awalnya, Tony merenovasi
tempat ini sendirian.</font>

171
00:10:11,541 --> 00:10:14,833
<font size="20">Lalu dia menggandeng Ventham
untuk modal tambahan.</font>

172
00:10:14,916 --> 00:10:17,083
<font size="20">- Jadi, mereka rekan bisnis?
- Ya.</font>

173
00:10:17,166 --> 00:10:20,041
<font size="20">- Tony agak…
- Sangar, ya? Tenang saja.</font>

174
00:10:20,125 --> 00:10:23,041
<font size="20">Tony melindungi kita. Itu yang terpenting.</font>

175
00:10:23,125 --> 00:10:25,208
<font size="20">"Melindungi kita"?</font>

176
00:10:25,291 --> 00:10:29,583
<font size="20">Kabarnya, Ian Ventham
ingin menutup Coopers Chase.</font>

177
00:10:30,375 --> 00:10:32,416
<font size="20">Apa? Kenapa?</font>

178
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:35,333
<font size="20">Dijadikan apartemen mewah. Kita tergusur.</font>

179
00:10:35,416 --> 00:10:37,375
<font size="20">Aku baru saja masuk.</font>

180
00:10:37,458 --> 00:10:41,416
<font size="20">Tony pasti akan menentang proyeknya,
apalagi masih ada Maud.</font>

181
00:10:41,916 --> 00:10:45,125
<font size="20">Jadi, Tony Curran
punya peran penting bagi kita.</font>

182
00:10:46,125 --> 00:10:47,458
<font size="20">Begitu pun Maud.</font>

183
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,541
<font size="20">- Kita makan kuenya dulu, ya?
- Ayo.</font>

184
00:10:56,625 --> 00:11:00,875
<font size="20">Thursday Murder Club
sudah lama mencari ahli medis.</font>

185
00:11:00,958 --> 00:11:05,875
<font size="20">Jadi, Joyce, kami ingin kau bergabung.
Hanya sementara.</font>

186
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:08,083
<font size="20">Sepertinya menyenangkan.</font>

187
00:11:08,708 --> 00:11:12,625
<font size="20">Kuenya maknyus, Joyce.
Aku bisa makan ini tiap hari.</font>

188
00:11:12,708 --> 00:11:16,750
<font size="20">Jangan sampai ketagihan, Ron.
Ingat kolesterolmu.</font>

189
00:11:16,833 --> 00:11:19,000
<font size="20">Tapi kuenya memang nikmat.</font>

190
00:11:19,083 --> 00:11:21,500
<font size="20">- Patut dipuji.
- Terima kasih.</font>

191
00:11:21,583 --> 00:11:25,500
<font size="20">Sebenarnya untuk anakku,
tapi perimenopause tak bisa makan manis.</font>

192
00:11:25,583 --> 00:11:30,208
<font size="20">Bisa kita berhenti sejenak
membahas kuenya?</font>

193
00:11:30,291 --> 00:11:31,750
<font size="20">- Joyce?
- Ya?</font>

194
00:11:34,458 --> 00:11:37,250
<font size="20">- Foto yang kau lihat tadi…
- Ya?</font>

195
00:11:37,333 --> 00:11:40,041
<font size="20">Dia korban kasus dingin yang kami usut.</font>

196
00:11:40,125 --> 00:11:43,750
<font size="20">Angela Hughes, "kasus wanita
berpakaian putih yang jatuh dari jendela".</font>

197
00:11:44,750 --> 00:11:45,583
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

198
00:11:46,125 --> 00:11:49,333
<font size="20">Laporan polisi menyebut
pacar Angela, Peter Mercer,</font>

199
00:11:49,416 --> 00:11:52,041
<font size="20">sempat diperiksa,
tapi kemudian dibebaskan.</font>

200
00:11:52,125 --> 00:11:56,291
<font size="20">Polisi menilainya orang baik
dan percaya cerita tentang perampok itu.</font>

201
00:11:56,375 --> 00:12:02,708
<font size="20">Namun, satu-satunya detektif wanita
di sana saat itu, Penny Gray,</font>

202
00:12:02,791 --> 00:12:06,125
<font size="20">ingin memeriksa ulang Mercer,
tapi permintaannya ditolak.</font>

203
00:12:06,208 --> 00:12:08,375
<font size="20">Para polisi pria ini kompak menolak.</font>

204
00:12:08,458 --> 00:12:10,291
<font size="20">Tidak lama berselang,</font>

205
00:12:10,375 --> 00:12:12,750
<font size="20">Mercer menghilang bak ditelan bumi.</font>

206
00:12:13,291 --> 00:12:14,541
<font size="20">Kasus pun ditutup.</font>

207
00:12:15,125 --> 00:12:16,458
<font size="20">Sampai kami gali lagi.</font>

208
00:12:16,541 --> 00:12:19,166
<font size="20">Dari mana kalian dapat berkas kasus?</font>

209
00:12:19,250 --> 00:12:22,083
<font size="20">Itu dokumen rahasia, bukan?</font>

210
00:12:22,166 --> 00:12:26,458
<font size="20">Memang rahasia.
Itu dari rekan pendiri klub ini</font>

211
00:12:26,541 --> 00:12:29,291
<font size="20">sekaligus sahabatku, Penny.</font>

212
00:12:29,375 --> 00:12:34,166
<font size="20">Ah, Detektif Penny Gray,
yang ingin memeriksa Mercer lebih lanjut?</font>

213
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:35,833
<font size="20">Ya, dialah orangnya.</font>

214
00:12:35,916 --> 00:12:38,833
<font size="20">Menarik. Apa dia baru ikut kita
pekan depan?</font>

215
00:12:40,458 --> 00:12:42,125
<font size="20">Dia tak ikut.</font>

216
00:12:43,083 --> 00:12:45,208
<font size="20">Sekarang Penny pasien di hospice.</font>

217
00:12:51,333 --> 00:12:52,375
<font size="20">Turut prihatin.</font>

218
00:12:53,416 --> 00:12:54,250
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

219
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:59,791
<font size="20">Sayang, aku ingin mengabarimu
kasus dingin terbaru kami.</font>

220
00:12:59,875 --> 00:13:01,958
<font size="20">Ibrahim bersikeras menamainya</font>

221
00:13:02,041 --> 00:13:05,416
<font size="20">"kasus wanita berpakaian putih
yang jatuh dari jendela".</font>

222
00:13:05,916 --> 00:13:08,041
<font size="20">Yang benar saja. Tapi menarik, ya?</font>

223
00:13:08,541 --> 00:13:10,333
<font size="20">Kasus ini memang rumit.</font>

224
00:13:10,916 --> 00:13:12,125
<font size="20">Kau pasti suka.</font>

225
00:13:13,208 --> 00:13:17,000
<font size="20">Kuncinya ada pada lamanya korban
sekarat kehabisan darah.</font>

226
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:19,125
<font size="20">Tapi kami cukup beruntung.</font>

227
00:13:19,625 --> 00:13:22,541
<font size="20">- Beruntung?
- Ya. Ada bantuan.</font>

228
00:13:22,625 --> 00:13:25,583
<font size="20">Ada pensiunan perawat baru masuk.
Namanya Joyce.</font>

229
00:13:25,666 --> 00:13:29,041
<font size="20">Orangnya ramah walau sedikit lugu.</font>

230
00:13:29,125 --> 00:13:32,291
<font size="20">Tapi dia paham
tentang luka tusuk dan sejenisnya.</font>

231
00:13:32,375 --> 00:13:34,375
<font size="20">Tiap orang memang punya peran.</font>

232
00:13:34,458 --> 00:13:38,125
<font size="20">Pen, andai saja kau membantu kami.</font>

233
00:13:38,208 --> 00:13:42,416
<font size="20">Kasus ini menarik.
Kenapa tak mengusulkan ini sebelum kau…</font>

234
00:13:47,458 --> 00:13:49,625
<font size="20">John, dia bisa mendengar kita?</font>

235
00:13:51,375 --> 00:13:53,625
<font size="20">Kadang aku berharap bisa,</font>

236
00:13:54,416 --> 00:13:58,333
<font size="20">kadang tidak bisa. Yang penting,
aku selalu membacakan buku.</font>

237
00:13:59,166 --> 00:14:00,916
<font size="20">Semoga cerita detektif.</font>

238
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:01,875
<font size="20">Tentu saja.</font>

239
00:14:01,958 --> 00:14:05,875
<font size="20">Dulu dia hampir mati bosan
sebelum kau masuk.</font>

240
00:14:05,958 --> 00:14:08,625
<font size="20">Klub kalian yang menghiburnya.</font>

241
00:14:09,416 --> 00:14:11,000
<font size="20">Kalian tim yang hebat.</font>

242
00:14:14,625 --> 00:14:16,000
<font size="20">Stephen apa kabar?</font>

243
00:14:16,666 --> 00:14:18,041
<font size="20">Seperti yang kau duga.</font>

244
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:22,958
<font size="20">Demensia itu memburuk seiring waktu.</font>

245
00:14:23,041 --> 00:14:24,875
<font size="20">Dia tak akan membaik.</font>

246
00:14:24,958 --> 00:14:26,833
<font size="20">Kadang dia ingat, kadang tidak.</font>

247
00:14:26,916 --> 00:14:32,250
<font size="20">Kadang dia seperti Stephen yang kusayang.
Cerdas, bicaranya jelas.</font>

248
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:35,250
<font size="20">Lalu sekejap, dia menghilang lagi.</font>

249
00:14:36,625 --> 00:14:37,458
<font size="20">Menghilang.</font>

250
00:14:39,125 --> 00:14:40,916
<font size="20">Nikmati momen-momen baiknya.</font>

251
00:14:45,041 --> 00:14:47,625
<font size="20">- Stephen, aku pulang.
- Halo, Sayang.</font>

252
00:14:48,125 --> 00:14:49,375
<font size="20">Harimu menyenangkan?</font>

253
00:14:49,458 --> 00:14:51,875
<font size="20">Ya, terima kasih. Kau?</font>

254
00:14:52,458 --> 00:14:53,291
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

255
00:14:53,833 --> 00:14:56,750
<font size="20">- Tadi makan siangku diantar.
- Wah, apa menunya?</font>

256
00:14:58,041 --> 00:14:59,208
<font size="20">Aduh.</font>

257
00:15:00,041 --> 00:15:01,083
<font size="20">Aku lupa.</font>

258
00:15:01,916 --> 00:15:05,000
<font size="20">Apa pun itu, rasanya enak.</font>

259
00:15:05,083 --> 00:15:09,250
<font size="20">Makan siang hari ini pai ayam
dengan bawang prei dan kentang rebus.</font>

260
00:15:10,125 --> 00:15:11,000
<font size="20">Sedap.</font>

261
00:15:11,083 --> 00:15:12,291
<font size="20">Sepertinya enak.</font>

262
00:15:12,375 --> 00:15:15,125
<font size="20">- Sedang baca apa?
- Aku…</font>

263
00:15:16,125 --> 00:15:21,125
<font size="20">Tadi saat memandangi kebun,
ada burung murai sendirian.</font>

264
00:15:21,916 --> 00:15:27,791
<font size="20">Karena khawatir, aku mencari tahu.
Kau tahu mereka hewan monogami?</font>

265
00:15:28,458 --> 00:15:29,625
<font size="20">Manis sekali, ya?</font>

266
00:15:30,375 --> 00:15:31,583
<font size="20">Mirip kita.</font>

267
00:15:36,458 --> 00:15:40,541
<font size="20">Gawat, sudah sesore ini.
Aku terlambat bertemu penerbit.</font>

268
00:15:40,625 --> 00:15:42,000
<font size="20">- Santai saja.
- Santai?</font>

269
00:15:42,083 --> 00:15:45,083
<font size="20">Tak perlu terburu-buru.
Kuseduhkan teh dulu, ya?</font>

270
00:15:45,166 --> 00:15:48,208
<font size="20">- Tidurlah sejenak.
- Ya. Baiklah.</font>

271
00:16:24,416 --> 00:16:25,750
<font size="20">Semuanya, hai.</font>

272
00:16:26,958 --> 00:16:28,291
<font size="20">Maaf terlambat. Saya…</font>

273
00:16:29,125 --> 00:16:33,625
<font size="20">Saya Donna De Freitas
dari Kepolisian Fairhaven.</font>

274
00:16:34,208 --> 00:16:39,750
<font size="20">Hari ini, saya ingin berbagi
kiat-kiat menjaga keamanan rumah.</font>

275
00:16:39,833 --> 00:16:41,625
<font size="20">Anda polisi betulan?</font>

276
00:16:42,333 --> 00:16:46,041
<font size="20">Ya, iyalah, Marjorie. Sopan sedikit.</font>

277
00:16:46,125 --> 00:16:49,666
<font size="20">Ya, saya polisi betulan.</font>

278
00:16:50,208 --> 00:16:53,041
<font size="20">Baguslah. Saya ada pertanyaan. Ini serius.</font>

279
00:16:53,125 --> 00:16:54,375
<font size="20">- Begini.
- Baik.</font>

280
00:16:55,041 --> 00:16:58,875
<font size="20">Jika seseorang membunuh pacarnya
secara sadis, lalu menghilang,</font>

281
00:16:58,958 --> 00:17:00,916
<font size="20">berapa lama kasusnya diselidiki</font>

282
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:03,583
<font size="20">sebelum pelaku dinyatakan orang hilang?</font>

283
00:17:07,958 --> 00:17:09,708
<font size="20">Anu, itu…</font>

284
00:17:10,958 --> 00:17:14,791
<font size="20">Apa hubungannya dengan keamanan di rumah?</font>

285
00:17:16,458 --> 00:17:21,166
<font size="20">Jangan sampai ini penyuluhan basi
soal cara mengunci pintu lagi.</font>

286
00:17:22,166 --> 00:17:24,458
<font size="20">Kami juga paham harus tanya identitas.</font>

287
00:17:24,541 --> 00:17:28,208
<font size="20">"Anda betulan teknisi gas atau maling?"</font>

288
00:17:29,833 --> 00:17:30,666
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

289
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:32,333
<font size="20">Maling boleh masuk apartemenku.</font>

290
00:17:32,833 --> 00:17:34,458
<font size="20">Aku malah senang ada tamu.</font>

291
00:17:40,416 --> 00:17:43,208
<font size="20">Sebenarnya, saya ingin bahas</font>

292
00:17:44,125 --> 00:17:46,750
<font size="20">tentang gelang keselamatan.</font>

293
00:17:52,625 --> 00:17:53,833
<font size="20">Astaga.</font>

294
00:17:54,750 --> 00:17:55,875
<font size="20">Ya ampun!</font>

295
00:17:56,958 --> 00:17:58,916
<font size="20">- Itu mobilku.
- Mohon maaf.</font>

296
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:02,458
<font size="20">Petugas parkir di sini
memang terlalu ketat.</font>

297
00:18:02,541 --> 00:18:05,125
<font size="20">- Seperti fasis.
- Ini ngawur. Aku polisi.</font>

298
00:18:05,208 --> 00:18:07,583
<font size="20">Mau raja pun tetap akan diderek.</font>

299
00:18:07,666 --> 00:18:11,500
<font size="20">Ya, sepertinya kau
akan terjebak satu jam di sini.</font>

300
00:18:14,541 --> 00:18:16,666
<font size="20">Mau ikut makan siang?</font>

301
00:18:19,208 --> 00:18:21,458
<font size="20">- Pesan masing-masing sebotol?
- Boleh.</font>

302
00:18:21,541 --> 00:18:24,500
<font size="20">- Sebotol apa?
- Anggur. Merah dan putih.</font>

303
00:18:24,583 --> 00:18:26,583
<font size="20">Oh, masih terlalu pagi buatku.</font>

304
00:18:26,666 --> 00:18:30,041
<font size="20">Bagi yang bangun subuh,
rasanya ini sudah sore.</font>

305
00:18:30,125 --> 00:18:31,416
<font size="20">Tebak umurku.</font>

306
00:18:33,208 --> 00:18:34,208
<font size="20">Umur 78?</font>

307
00:18:34,708 --> 00:18:37,041
<font size="20">- Tapi awet muda, kok.
- Berkat pilates.</font>

308
00:18:37,125 --> 00:18:40,291
<font size="20">Oh, pantas wajahmu terlihat awet muda,</font>

309
00:18:40,375 --> 00:18:43,166
<font size="20">tapi keriput di tangan tak bisa bohong.</font>

310
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:44,875
<font size="20">Analisis yang bagus.</font>

311
00:18:44,958 --> 00:18:48,083
<font size="20">Konstabel De Freitas,
ini pekerjaan pertamamu?</font>

312
00:18:48,166 --> 00:18:52,208
<font size="20">Bukan. Aku sempat bertugas
di Kepolisian Metropolitan London,</font>

313
00:18:52,291 --> 00:18:54,458
<font size="20">lalu keluar dan pindah ke sini.</font>

314
00:18:54,541 --> 00:18:56,916
<font size="20">Di sini kerasan? Atau malah bosan?</font>

315
00:18:59,666 --> 00:19:02,041
<font size="20">Tenang. Kami bisa jaga rahasia.</font>

316
00:19:03,250 --> 00:19:04,083
<font size="20">Kalau begitu,</font>

317
00:19:05,166 --> 00:19:09,833
<font size="20">ya, nyaris gila aku
mencatat tilang seharian.</font>

318
00:19:12,583 --> 00:19:14,791
<font size="20">Kalian lajang? Sudah menikah?</font>

319
00:19:14,875 --> 00:19:16,416
<font size="20">Lajang sejati.</font>

320
00:19:16,916 --> 00:19:18,458
<font size="20">Sudah cerai. Dua kali.</font>

321
00:19:20,666 --> 00:19:21,500
<font size="20">Janda.</font>

322
00:19:22,416 --> 00:19:25,666
<font size="20">Kalau Elizabeth bersuami. Namanya Stephen.</font>

323
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:28,416
<font size="20">Oh, begitu? Dia akan menyusul ke sini?</font>

324
00:19:29,083 --> 00:19:30,833
<font size="20">Tidak, harus kejar tenggat.</font>

325
00:19:30,916 --> 00:19:32,666
<font size="20">Stephen penulis buku.</font>

326
00:19:32,750 --> 00:19:35,833
<font size="20">Benarkah? Sebelum pensiun,
apa pekerjaanmu?</font>

327
00:19:35,916 --> 00:19:39,500
<font size="20">Psikiater. Spesialis menangani
veteran perang dengan PTSD.</font>

328
00:19:39,583 --> 00:19:41,708
<font size="20">Kalau kau, Ron?</font>

329
00:19:42,416 --> 00:19:43,916
<font size="20">Anggota serikat buruh.</font>

330
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:47,083
<font size="20">Bukan sebarang anggota, Ron.</font>

331
00:19:47,166 --> 00:19:51,375
<font size="20">Kau tokoh buruh. Dulu dijuluki Red Ron.</font>

332
00:19:51,458 --> 00:19:55,833
<font size="20">Iya. Karena setiap ada mogok kerja,
demo, atau aksi duduk,</font>

333
00:19:55,916 --> 00:19:58,875
<font size="20">aku selalu hadir
untuk membakar semangat massa.</font>

334
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:01,750
<font size="20">Masa-masa jaya.</font>

335
00:20:02,541 --> 00:20:03,791
<font size="20">Kau, Joyce?</font>

336
00:20:03,875 --> 00:20:05,583
<font size="20">Aku biasa-biasa saja.</font>

337
00:20:05,666 --> 00:20:08,291
<font size="20">Awalnya perawat,
jadi ibu, lalu perawat lagi.</font>

338
00:20:08,375 --> 00:20:11,541
<font size="20">Putriku, Joanna, yang menarik.</font>

339
00:20:11,625 --> 00:20:14,750
<font size="20">Dia mengelola dana lindung nilai.
Mungkin kalian tahu.</font>

340
00:20:14,833 --> 00:20:15,833
<font size="20">- Tidak.
- Tak tahu.</font>

341
00:20:15,916 --> 00:20:16,833
<font size="20">Sama.</font>

342
00:20:17,750 --> 00:20:18,958
<font size="20">Kau, Elizabeth?</font>

343
00:20:19,583 --> 00:20:20,541
<font size="20">Apa pekerjaanmu?</font>

344
00:20:22,791 --> 00:20:24,166
<font size="20">Hubungan internasional.</font>

345
00:20:25,500 --> 00:20:26,875
<font size="20">Kau diplomat?</font>

346
00:20:29,375 --> 00:20:32,208
<font size="20">Pokoknya, pekerjaan
yang menuntutku serbabisa.</font>

347
00:20:32,291 --> 00:20:34,541
<font size="20">- Anggur?
- Sampai juga. Terima kasih.</font>

348
00:20:34,625 --> 00:20:35,791
<font size="20">Aku mau itu.</font>

349
00:20:35,875 --> 00:20:38,750
<font size="20">Pesan apa, ya? Coba kulihat.</font>

350
00:20:38,833 --> 00:20:41,000
<font size="20">- Biar kupesankan.
- Serius?</font>

351
00:20:41,083 --> 00:20:42,583
<font size="20">Ayo, Jackie. Cepat.</font>

352
00:20:43,791 --> 00:20:45,208
<font size="20">Megahnya kompleks ini.</font>

353
00:20:45,708 --> 00:20:47,750
<font size="20">Jadi ingin cepat tua.</font>

354
00:20:49,583 --> 00:20:53,333
<font size="20">Maksudku, ingin cepat
menikmati usia senja.</font>

355
00:20:53,416 --> 00:20:55,416
<font size="20">Coopers Chase memang istimewa.</font>

356
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:57,250
<font size="20">- Hei!
- Kami beruntung…</font>

357
00:20:57,333 --> 00:20:59,583
<font size="20">- Datang juga.
- Jason rupanya.</font>

358
00:20:59,666 --> 00:21:00,750
<font size="20">Apa kabar, Ayah?</font>

359
00:21:00,833 --> 00:21:02,958
<font size="20">Baik, Nak. Senang melihatmu.</font>

360
00:21:03,541 --> 00:21:04,666
<font size="20">Itu Jason Ritchie?</font>

361
00:21:04,750 --> 00:21:07,166
<font size="20">Ya, dia artis kita. Anaknya Ron.</font>

362
00:21:07,250 --> 00:21:09,250
<font size="20">Dia menjenguk 2-3 kali seminggu.</font>

363
00:21:09,833 --> 00:21:11,041
<font size="20">Wah, Ibsy.</font>

364
00:21:11,125 --> 00:21:12,916
<font size="20">- Jason.
- Halo, Jason.</font>

365
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:16,541
<font size="20">- Elizabeth.
- Jason, ini Konstabel Donna De Freitas.</font>

366
00:21:16,625 --> 00:21:18,333
<font size="20">- Hai. Salam kenal.
- Hai.</font>

367
00:21:18,416 --> 00:21:19,916
