470
00:27:21,958 --> 00:27:24,541
<font size="20">Korban dihantam hingga tewas.</font>

471
00:27:24,625 --> 00:27:26,916
<font size="20">Tersangka belum ditetapkan.</font>

472
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:29,625
