548
00:31:39,916 --> 00:31:42,541
<font size="20">Macam-macam. Aku ada rencana.</font>

549
00:31:42,625 --> 00:31:46,958
<font size="20">Elizabeth-ku tersayang.
Tak pernah kehabisan rencana.</font>

550
00:31:49,291 --> 00:31:50,166
<font size="20">Ke kanan.</font>

551
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:03,291
<font size="20">Aku suka kardiganmu.</font>

552
00:32:04,375 --> 00:32:05,500
<font size="20">Sekarang bagaimana?</font>

553
00:32:05,583 --> 00:32:06,708
<font size="20">Ikuti saja.</font>

554
00:32:07,666 --> 00:32:09,125
<font size="20">Mendebarkan sekali.</font>

555
00:32:09,208 --> 00:32:11,458
<font size="20">Serasa di drama Minggu malam</font>

556
00:32:11,541 --> 00:32:15,958
<font size="20">tentang dua nenek detektif yang lincah,
tengil, dan lebih gesit dari polisi.</font>

557
00:32:16,041 --> 00:32:17,125
<font size="20">Setuju?</font>

558
00:32:17,208 --> 00:32:19,125
<font size="20">- Tidak. Joyce…
- Ya?</font>

559
00:32:19,208 --> 00:32:22,958
<font size="20">Jangan sebut "nenek lincah dan tengil"
di depanku lagi.</font>

560
00:32:23,041 --> 00:32:23,875
<font size="20">Baiklah.</font>

561
00:32:29,708 --> 00:32:31,750
<font size="20">Anak Muda, tolong aku.</font>

562
00:32:31,833 --> 00:32:35,833
<font size="20">- Tasku dijambret di depan…
- Marks and Spencer's.</font>

563
00:32:35,916 --> 00:32:37,625
<font size="20">Ya, Marks and Spencer's.</font>

564
00:32:37,708 --> 00:32:42,291
<font size="20">Seluruh hartaku di tas.
Uang pensiun, tunai, semuanya. Tolong.</font>

565
00:32:42,375 --> 00:32:45,666
<font size="20">Baik. Saya catat dulu.</font>

566
00:32:45,750 --> 00:32:48,875
<font size="20">Tidak, tolong panggilkan polisi wanita.</font>

567
00:32:48,958 --> 00:32:52,791
<font size="20">Saya jamin, saya juga kompeten
dan sangat sabar.</font>

568
00:32:52,875 --> 00:32:54,458
<font size="20">- Harus wanita.
- Tapi…</font>

569
00:32:54,541 --> 00:32:55,750
<font size="20">Dia biarawati!</font>

570
00:32:58,125 --> 00:32:58,958
<font size="20">Benar.</font>

571
00:33:00,416 --> 00:33:02,750
<font size="20">Benar, aku biarawati.</font>

572
00:33:03,500 --> 00:33:07,250
<font size="20">Aku sudah berkaul.
Tak bisa dekat dengan pria mana pun.</font>

573
00:33:07,833 --> 00:33:09,375
<font size="20">Kecuali Yesus, tentunya.</font>

574
00:33:10,750 --> 00:33:11,916
<font size="20">Baiklah…</font>

575
00:33:12,958 --> 00:33:14,458
<font size="20">- Tunggu.
- Cepat, ya.</font>

576
00:33:14,541 --> 00:33:16,250
<font size="20">Saya paham. Tunggu.</font>

577
00:33:19,791 --> 00:33:22,875
<font size="20">Biarawati. Cerdas.
Kenapa tak terpikir olehku?</font>

578
00:33:24,666 --> 00:33:27,083
<font size="20">Ibu-Ibu, bisa saya…</font>

579
00:33:30,916 --> 00:33:32,000
<font size="20">bantu?</font>

580
00:33:35,416 --> 00:33:37,750
<font size="20">RUANG PEMERIKSAAN - DIREKAM</font>

581
00:33:38,333 --> 00:33:41,541
<font size="20">- Benarkah tasmu dicuri?
- Tidak.</font>

582
00:33:41,625 --> 00:33:45,125
<font size="20">Coba curi saja kalau berani.
Tahu rasa nanti.</font>

583
00:33:47,041 --> 00:33:49,958
<font size="20">Kalau begitu, apa tujuan kalian di sini?</font>

584
00:33:50,041 --> 00:33:53,166
<font size="20">Aku harus kembali memburu penjahat.</font>

585
00:33:53,250 --> 00:33:55,833
<font size="20">Pas sekali. Sebelum itu, dengarkan ini.</font>

586
00:33:55,916 --> 00:34:01,125
<font size="20">Jangan pura-pura tak senang bertemu kami.
Aku tahu kau senang. Kami juga senang.</font>

587
00:34:01,208 --> 00:34:04,375
<font size="20">Akan jauh lebih seru
jika kita semua jujur saja.</font>

588
00:34:08,083 --> 00:34:12,041
<font size="20">Sebagai catatan,
Konstabel De Freitas enggan menjawabnya,</font>

589
00:34:12,125 --> 00:34:14,583
<font size="20">tapi senyumnya mengembang tipis.</font>

590
00:34:16,125 --> 00:34:18,333
<font size="20">Kedua, sebelum kami datang,</font>

591
00:34:18,416 --> 00:34:21,791
<font size="20">kami tahu kau tak sedang memburu penjahat.</font>

592
00:34:22,541 --> 00:34:24,333
<font size="20">Pasti tugas membosankan.</font>

593
00:34:27,416 --> 00:34:28,500
<font size="20">Tak akan kujawab.</font>

594
00:34:29,625 --> 00:34:31,375
<font size="20">Kami ingin bertanya.</font>

595
00:34:33,041 --> 00:34:34,041
<font size="20">Silakan.</font>

596
00:34:34,625 --> 00:34:38,166
<font size="20">Tertarik masuk ke tim penyidik
kasus pembunuhan Tony Curran?</font>

597
00:34:42,041 --> 00:34:44,250
<font size="20">Itu mustahil.</font>

598
00:34:44,333 --> 00:34:47,208
<font size="20">Tapi kalau bisa kami atur,
apa kau berminat?</font>

599
00:34:48,875 --> 00:34:50,625
<font size="20">Kalau bisa kalian atur?</font>

600
00:34:51,166 --> 00:34:53,375
<font size="20">Memang kau kepala MI5?</font>

601
00:34:55,833 --> 00:34:56,666
<font size="20">Bukan.</font>

602
00:34:57,500 --> 00:35:02,000
<font size="20">Bukan. Aku hanya perempuan
yang tak menerima penolakan. Sepertimu.</font>

603
00:35:05,375 --> 00:35:06,416
<font size="20">Apa yang kalian incar?</font>

604
00:35:07,250 --> 00:35:09,416
<font size="20">Aku senang kau curiga.</font>

605
00:35:09,500 --> 00:35:12,208
<font size="20">Sifat yang paling kukagumi.</font>

606
00:35:12,291 --> 00:35:13,583
<font size="20">Baguslah.</font>

607
00:35:14,083 --> 00:35:18,250
<font size="20">Kalau begitu, bisa jelaskan
apa yang kalian incar, 'kan?</font>

608
00:35:19,625 --> 00:35:23,750
<font size="20">Kadang kami mungkin butuh informasi
soal penyelidikan.</font>

609
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:27,375
<font size="20">Aku tak boleh membocorkan rahasia.</font>

610
00:35:27,458 --> 00:35:30,250
<font size="20">Tak akan melanggar kode etik.
Aku bersumpah.</font>

611
00:35:31,125 --> 00:35:32,500
<font size="20">Sebagai hamba Tuhan.</font>

612
00:35:36,500 --> 00:35:38,375
<font size="20">Kalau aku bersedia</font>

613
00:35:38,458 --> 00:35:41,625
<font size="20">dibantu bergabung
ke tim penyidik kasus Tony Curran,</font>

614
00:35:43,375 --> 00:35:44,500
<font size="20">kapan mulainya?</font>

615
00:35:44,583 --> 00:35:46,166
<font size="20">- Sejam lagi.
- Sejam?</font>

616
00:35:46,250 --> 00:35:47,208
<font size="20">Tergantung kemacetan.</font>

617
00:35:47,291 --> 00:35:51,041
<font size="20">- Tim kami sudah siaga.
- Maksudnya Ron dan Ibrahim.</font>

618
00:35:51,125 --> 00:35:54,041
<font size="20">Ini nomor ponselku. Silakan dihubungi.</font>

619
00:35:54,541 --> 00:35:58,750
<font size="20">- Pemeriksaan berakhir pukul 12.47.
- Perekamnya mati, Joyce.</font>

620
00:35:58,833 --> 00:36:00,416
<font size="20">- Oh, ya. Mati.
- Ya.</font>

621
00:36:08,625 --> 00:36:09,666
<font size="20">Jalankan rencana.</font>

622
00:36:09,750 --> 00:36:10,958
<font size="20">Siap laksanakan.</font>

623
00:36:18,208 --> 00:36:21,333
<font size="20">Selamat sore.
Aku ingin bertemu Pak Ron Ritchie.</font>

624
00:36:21,416 --> 00:36:23,625
<font size="20">- Silakan, Inspektur.
- Terima kasih.</font>

625
00:36:26,375 --> 00:36:29,166
<font size="20">Ron? Polisinya datang.</font>

626
00:36:29,250 --> 00:36:33,208
<font size="20">Polisi! Tidak! Jangan ada polisi!</font>

627
00:36:33,291 --> 00:36:35,208
<font size="20">Apa maumu? Hah?</font>

628
00:36:35,291 --> 00:36:37,250
<font size="20">- Berdemo itu hak asasi!
- Tenang.</font>

629
00:36:37,333 --> 00:36:40,583
<font size="20">Maafkan Ron.
Dia tidak nyaman dengan aparat.</font>

630
00:36:40,666 --> 00:36:43,875
<font size="20">- Ron. Tenang, ya.
- Oke.</font>

631
00:36:43,958 --> 00:36:48,583
<font size="20">Dia ingin menanyakan pertengkaran
antara Ian Ventham dan Tony Curran.</font>

632
00:36:48,666 --> 00:36:51,500
<font size="20">Aku jamin, Pak Ritchie,
kau tidak akan ditangkap.</font>

633
00:36:51,583 --> 00:36:54,333
<font size="20">- Aku hanya ingin bertanya.
- Tidak!</font>

634
00:36:54,416 --> 00:36:57,583
<font size="20">Panggil polwan waktu itu.
Jangan dengan pria ini.</font>

635
00:36:58,166 --> 00:37:01,458
<font size="20">- Polwan?
- Kakak polwan cantik yang pernah ke sini.</font>

636
00:37:02,041 --> 00:37:05,958
<font size="20">De Freitas. Yang memberi penyuluhan
tentang keamanan di rumah.</font>

637
00:37:06,041 --> 00:37:07,958
<font size="20">Ron menyukainya.</font>

638
00:37:10,250 --> 00:37:12,666
<font size="20">Oh, ya.</font>

639
00:37:13,250 --> 00:37:16,083
<font size="20">Tidak bisa. Dia masih hijau.</font>

640
00:37:16,166 --> 00:37:19,916
<font size="20">Minim pengalaman.
Bukan anggota tim penyidik kasus ini…</font>

641
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:22,625
<font size="20">Aku maunya dia!</font>

642
00:37:22,708 --> 00:37:26,333
<font size="20">Maunya bicara dengan kakak polwan itu!</font>

643
00:37:27,166 --> 00:37:29,750
<font size="20">Maaf. Dia hanya mau bicara
dengan De Freit…</font>

644
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:33,958
<font size="20">Apa dia bisa dipindahkan ke timmu?</font>

645
00:37:40,333 --> 00:37:41,666
<font size="20">Akan kuusahakan.</font>

646
00:37:46,916 --> 00:37:47,916
<font size="20">Pintar kau, Ibsy.</font>

647
00:37:48,416 --> 00:37:50,250
<font size="20">Sangat pintar. Sungguh…</font>

648
00:37:52,958 --> 00:37:54,416
<font size="20">Konstabel De Freitas.</font>

649
00:37:54,916 --> 00:37:57,541
<font size="20">Baru ada kabar dari SDM. Kau dipindahkan.</font>

650
00:37:58,250 --> 00:38:00,333
<font size="20">- Ke mana?
- Ke Reskrim.</font>

651
00:38:00,833 --> 00:38:02,833
<font size="20">Reserse Kriminal.</font>

652
00:38:03,333 --> 00:38:06,250
<font size="20">Kau masuk ke tim penyidik
kasus Tony Curran.</font>

653
00:38:06,958 --> 00:38:07,958
<font size="20">Mustahil.</font>

654
00:38:08,958 --> 00:38:09,791
<font size="20">Serius?</font>

655
00:38:17,625 --> 00:38:20,375
<font size="20">DONNA: BELUM JUGA 20 MENIT! ANJIR?!</font>

656
00:38:21,750 --> 00:38:23,500
<font size="20">Apa artinya "anjir"?</font>

657
00:38:23,583 --> 00:38:24,500
<font size="20">Anjing.</font>

658
00:38:24,583 --> 00:38:25,458
<font size="20">Apa?</font>

659
00:38:25,541 --> 00:38:26,375
<font size="20">Anjing!</font>

660
00:38:29,208 --> 00:38:30,041
<font size="20">Maaf, ya.</font>

661
00:38:32,833 --> 00:38:34,083
<font size="20">Diajari putriku.</font>

662
00:38:34,708 --> 00:38:36,916
<font size="20">Harap maklum, temanku agak…</font>

663
00:38:40,083 --> 00:38:41,125
<font size="20">Enak saja.</font>

664
00:38:48,500 --> 00:38:52,000
<font size="20">LAPORAN TAHUNAN 2023
KOMPLEKS PENSIUNAN COOPERS CHASE (LLP.)</font>

665
00:38:58,666 --> 00:39:00,958
<font size="20">Wah, menarik.</font>

666
00:39:08,500 --> 00:39:13,541
<font size="20">COOPERS CHASE PUNYA INVESTOR KETIGA
YANG MASIH MISTERIUS</font>

667
00:39:13,625 --> 00:39:15,083
<font size="20">KENAPA BELUM TIDUR??</font>

668
00:39:33,041 --> 00:39:37,583
<font size="20">Joyce, temanku berhasil mendapatkan
laporan keuangan Coopers Chase.</font>

669
00:39:37,666 --> 00:39:40,791
<font size="20">Namun, isinya sulit sekali dipahami.</font>

670
00:39:40,875 --> 00:39:43,166
<font size="20">- Siapa tahu putrimu…
- Joanna.</font>

671
00:39:43,250 --> 00:39:45,666
<font size="20">Joanna. Dia orang keuangan, bukan?</font>

672
00:39:45,750 --> 00:39:48,875
<font size="20">Bisakah dia mengecek dan menguraikannya?</font>

673
00:39:49,541 --> 00:39:51,416
<font size="20">Diam-diam, tentunya.</font>

674
00:39:51,500 --> 00:39:55,666
<font size="20">Entahlah. Dia sibuk sekali.
Meneleponku pun jarang.</font>

675
00:39:55,750 --> 00:39:57,416
<font size="20">Coba dulu.</font>

676
00:39:58,041 --> 00:40:00,791
<font size="20">Untuk penyelidikan
yang serius dan efisien,</font>

677
00:40:00,875 --> 00:40:03,583
<font size="20">kita harus memanfaatkan
semua sumber daya kita.</font>

678
00:40:04,541 --> 00:40:05,958
<font size="20">- Kuusahakan.
- Bagus.</font>

679
00:40:09,000 --> 00:40:10,708
<font size="20">Joyce, kau berbakat.</font>

680
00:40:14,416 --> 00:40:17,500
<font size="20">Maksud Ibu, itu klub tentang pembunuhan?</font>

681
00:40:18,083 --> 00:40:20,125
<font size="20">Seperti siniar kasus kriminal?</font>

682
00:40:20,208 --> 00:40:24,000
<font size="20">Bisa dibilang begitu,
tapi kami menyelidiki pembunuhan.</font>

683
00:40:25,166 --> 00:40:26,666
<font size="20">Terdengar mengerikan.</font>

684
00:40:26,750 --> 00:40:29,208
<font size="20">Memang terdengar agak gila,</font>

685
00:40:29,291 --> 00:40:32,083
<font size="20">tapi mereka baik sekali.
Kami saling melengkapi.</font>

686
00:40:32,666 --> 00:40:35,666
<font size="20">Jadi, bisa bantu cek laporan keuangannya?</font>

687
00:40:35,750 --> 00:40:38,458
<font size="20">Ibu pasti tahu, 'kan? Aku sibuk.</font>

688
00:40:38,541 --> 00:40:40,208
<font size="20">Bukan main, Joanna.</font>

689
00:40:40,708 --> 00:40:44,833
<font size="20">Kau hampir tak pernah menelepon,
menengok tak sampai sejam,</font>

690
00:40:44,916 --> 00:40:46,625
<font size="20">sekarang kue Ibu tak dimakan!</font>

691
00:40:46,708 --> 00:40:51,666
<font size="20">Ibu cuma minta, tolong sisihkan sebentar
klien miliardermu itu</font>

692
00:40:51,750 --> 00:40:55,375
<font size="20">dan bantu ibumu satu-satunya,
sekali ini saja!</font>

693
00:40:57,791 --> 00:40:59,708
<font size="20">- Kuusahakan.
- Terima kasih.</font>

694
00:41:01,416 --> 00:41:02,416
<font size="20">Riwayat pidana Tony.</font>

695
00:41:02,500 --> 00:41:06,166
<font size="20">Ugal-ugalan di jalan, penganiayaan ringan,
kepemilikan senjata ilegal.</font>

696
00:41:06,250 --> 00:41:07,125
<font size="20">Masih banyak lagi.</font>

697
00:41:07,208 --> 00:41:09,708
<font size="20">Pasti banyak orang yang ingin dia mati,</font>

698
00:41:09,791 --> 00:41:13,208
<font size="20">tapi kita cari tahu dulu
siapa pria kedua di foto itu.</font>

699
00:41:13,291 --> 00:41:14,166
<font size="20">Foto apa?</font>

700
00:41:14,250 --> 00:41:18,375
<font size="20">Foto di TKP kasus Curran.
Banyak yang berserak.</font>

701
00:41:18,458 --> 00:41:20,708
<font size="20">Foto liburan, kondangan, dan lainnya.</font>

702
00:41:20,791 --> 00:41:24,000
<font size="20">Tapi ada satu foto
bersama pria yang belum dikenali.</font>

703
00:41:24,083 --> 00:41:28,291
<font size="20">Tim forensik baru selesai menganalisis.
Kau ingin melihatnya?</font>

704
00:41:28,833 --> 00:41:29,833
<font size="20">Ya. Mau, dong.</font>

705
00:41:30,750 --> 00:41:31,625
<font size="20">Maaf.</font>

706
00:41:31,708 --> 00:41:34,041
<font size="20">Tidak cocok diucapkan di Reskrim, ya?</font>

707
00:41:34,125 --> 00:41:36,458
<font size="20">Jangan tanya aku soal cocok atau tidak.</font>

708
00:41:36,541 --> 00:41:38,541
<font size="20">Silakan lihat fotonya, De Freitas.</font>

709
00:41:39,333 --> 00:41:42,375
<font size="20">Donna saja. Agak aneh dipanggil begitu.</font>

710
00:41:43,500 --> 00:41:44,333
<font size="20">Donna?</font>

711
00:41:45,250 --> 00:41:46,083
<font size="20">Itu namaku.</font>

712
00:41:47,500 --> 00:41:48,583
<font size="20">Nama depanku.</font>

713
00:41:49,125 --> 00:41:54,833
<font size="20">Akan kuusahakan, tapi aku
jarang memanggil nama depan.</font>

714
00:41:54,916 --> 00:41:57,458
<font size="20">Nama depan Griffiths pun aku tak tahu.</font>

715
00:41:57,541 --> 00:41:59,375
<font size="20">Padahal tujuh tahun jadi rekan.</font>

716
00:41:59,958 --> 00:42:02,041
<font size="20">Kau tak tahu siapa pria ini?</font>

717
00:42:02,125 --> 00:42:04,541
<font size="20">Tidak. Masih ditelusuri Griffiths.</font>

718
00:42:04,625 --> 00:42:07,500
<font size="20">Minta dia berhenti. Ini Bobby Tanner.</font>

719
00:42:07,583 --> 00:42:08,416
<font size="20">Apa?</font>

720
00:42:08,916 --> 00:42:10,583
<font size="20">Dia gembong kriminal.</font>

721
00:42:10,666 --> 00:42:13,833
<font size="20">Polisi Metropolitan
sudah bertahun-tahun memburunya.</font>

722
00:42:14,333 --> 00:42:15,333
<font size="20">Ternyata di sini.</font>

723
00:42:15,916 --> 00:42:16,958
<font size="20">Ironis.</font>

724
00:42:17,041 --> 00:42:21,333
<font size="20">- Polisi Metropolitan tak menemukannya?
- Ya. Satu hal lagi.</font>

725
00:42:21,916 --> 00:42:24,333
<font size="20">Ada orang ketiga, tapi terpotong.</font>

726
00:42:24,416 --> 00:42:25,291
<font size="20">Apa?</font>

727
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:26,833
<font size="20">Ya, lihat ini.</font>

728
00:42:26,916 --> 00:42:29,250
<font size="20">Lengannya terpantul di cermin.</font>

729
00:42:29,958 --> 00:42:30,958
<font size="20">Oh, iya.</font>

730
00:42:32,625 --> 00:42:33,666
<font size="20">Jeli sekali.</font>

731
00:42:35,666 --> 00:42:37,166
<font size="20">Griffiths akan kukabari.</font>

732
00:42:38,333 --> 00:42:39,750
<font size="20">Sepanas mungkin, Joyce.</font>

