- Apa?</font>

914
00:52:24,375 --> 00:52:27,500
<font size="20">Jason adalah pria ketiga
yang ada di foto itu.</font>

915
00:52:28,041 --> 00:52:31,166
<font size="20">Itu lengan dia di cermin.
Tatonya sama. Mana ponselmu?</font>

916
00:52:31,250 --> 00:52:32,791
<font size="20">Ada di sini.</font>

917
00:52:33,958 --> 00:52:35,166
<font size="20">Coba, tunjukkan.</font>

918
00:52:36,916 --> 00:52:37,750
<font size="20">Lihat.</font>

919
00:52:42,958 --> 00:52:45,833
<font size="20">- Jason juga buru-buru pergi.
- Benar sekali.</font>

920
00:52:46,416 --> 00:52:49,375
<font size="20">Kita awasi dia dan Ian Ventham.</font>

921
00:52:50,250 --> 00:52:52,458
<font size="20">Jangan sampai mereka kabur.</font>

922
00:53:07,500 --> 00:53:09,250
<font size="20">Kau disalip pengemudi pemula.</font>

923
00:53:09,333 --> 00:53:11,875
<font size="20">Tolonglah. Kita mau menguji seberapa cepat</font>

924
00:53:11,958 --> 00:53:15,416
<font size="20">Ian Ventham bisa sampai
ke rumah Tony dari Coopers Chase!</font>

925
00:53:15,500 --> 00:53:16,875
<font size="20">Seberapa "cepat"!</font>

926
00:53:17,458 --> 00:53:19,000
<font size="20">Ada yang mau permen jeli?</font>

927
00:53:19,500 --> 00:53:21,791
<font size="20">Perhitunganku tidak hanya dari laju mobil.</font>

928
00:53:21,875 --> 00:53:25,000
<font size="20">Aku punya algoritma kompleks
yang bisa menentukan</font>

929
00:53:25,083 --> 00:53:28,083
<font size="20">apakah Ian Ventham
sempat membunuh Tony Curran.</font>

930
00:53:28,166 --> 00:53:30,041
<font size="20">Sabar dulu.</font>

931
00:53:39,833 --> 00:53:42,500
<font size="20">Hari ini aku sibuk.</font>

932
00:53:42,583 --> 00:53:45,125
<font size="20">Rekan bisnisku tewas. Aku sudah kewalahan.</font>

933
00:53:45,208 --> 00:53:49,083
<font size="20">Baiklah. Kau tahu siapa pria
yang bersama Tony ini?</font>

934
00:53:51,083 --> 00:53:53,791
<font size="20">- Itu Bobby Tanner.
- Benar, Bobby Tanner.</font>

935
00:53:53,875 --> 00:53:55,791
<font size="20">Polisi sudah lama memburunya.</font>

936
00:53:55,875 --> 00:53:57,791
<font size="20">Catatan kriminalnya panjang.</font>

937
00:53:57,875 --> 00:54:00,416
<font size="20">Namanya dikenal di mana-mana, katanya.</font>

938
00:54:00,500 --> 00:54:03,041
<font size="20">Kukira dia sudah mati. Dari mana foto ini?</font>

939
00:54:03,125 --> 00:54:04,416
<font size="20">Ada di TKP.</font>

940
00:54:05,583 --> 00:54:06,416
<font size="20">Benarkah?</font>

941
00:54:07,291 --> 00:54:08,583
<font size="20">Baiklah.</font>

942
00:54:08,666 --> 00:54:11,750
<font size="20">Kenapa kau bisa berurusan
dengan Bobby Tanner, Ian?</font>

943
00:54:12,291 --> 00:54:14,041
<font size="20">Dia orang yang berbahaya.</font>

944
00:54:14,541 --> 00:54:17,208
<font size="20">Senang memotong jari musuh,
dikirim lewat pos.</font>

945
00:54:17,291 --> 00:54:19,958
<font size="20">Pembeku di Scotland Yard sampai penuh.</font>

946
00:54:21,291 --> 00:54:24,666
<font size="20">Sebaiknya jujur sekarang
daripada terbongkar nanti.</font>

947
00:54:27,625 --> 00:54:28,958
<font size="20">Dia pemilik ketiga.</font>

948
00:54:30,458 --> 00:54:31,625
<font size="20">Pemilik apa?</font>

949
00:54:31,708 --> 00:54:34,166
<font size="20">Coopers Chase. Kalian ini telmi.</font>

950
00:54:36,375 --> 00:54:39,916
<font size="20">Tony menggandeng Bobby
demi suntikan dana agar proyek beres.</font>

951
00:54:40,416 --> 00:54:43,750
<font size="20">- Itu bukan ideku.
- Kau tahu dia di mana?</font>

952
00:54:43,833 --> 00:54:45,833
<font size="20">Kau tak dengar? Kukira dia mati.</font>

953
00:54:45,916 --> 00:54:47,250
<font size="20">Dia menghilang…</font>

954
00:54:48,166 --> 00:54:49,583
<font size="20">Bertahun-tahun!</font>

955
00:54:49,666 --> 00:54:51,875
<font size="20">Kalau dia masih hidup, tangkap dia.</font>

956
00:54:51,958 --> 00:54:53,291
<font size="20">Dia berbahaya.</font>

957
00:54:53,375 --> 00:54:55,416
<font size="20">Mungkinkah Bobby Tanner
yang membunuh Tony?</font>

958
00:54:55,500 --> 00:54:59,041
<font size="20">Mana kutahu. Itu tugas kalian.
Maaf, aku harus lanjut kerja.</font>

959
00:54:59,125 --> 00:55:02,083
<font size="20">Kenapa kau dan Curran bertengkar
sebelum dia tewas?</font>

960
00:55:03,333 --> 00:55:05,916
<font size="20">Urusan bisnis. Agak pelik ceritanya.</font>

961
00:55:06,500 --> 00:55:08,125
<font size="20">Jason Ritchie juga di foto itu.</font>

962
00:55:09,333 --> 00:55:10,875
<font size="20">Kelihatan dari tatonya.</font>

963
00:55:11,375 --> 00:55:13,416
<font size="20">Kau menyuruhnya membunuh Curran?</font>

964
00:55:13,916 --> 00:55:16,708
<font size="20">Peduli setan dengan Jason Ritchie.</font>

965
00:55:17,500 --> 00:55:20,000
<font size="20">Kau untung besar
jika rekan bisnismu meninggal.</font>

966
00:55:20,500 --> 00:55:23,708
<font size="20">Kau bisa mendapat 12 juta paun
karena Tony meninggal.</font>

967
00:55:24,208 --> 00:55:25,791
<font size="20">Tahu dari mana?</font>

968
00:55:28,291 --> 00:55:30,750
<font size="20">Aku tak membunuh Tony Curran.</font>

969
00:55:30,833 --> 00:55:33,583
<font size="20">Pagi ini, aku menemui investor.</font>

970
00:55:33,666 --> 00:55:36,208
<font size="20">Kalian fokus saja meringkus Bobby Tanner.</font>

971
00:55:36,291 --> 00:55:40,541
<font size="20">- Untuk keselamatan kita semua.
- Kenapa kau jadi senewen?</font>

972
00:55:40,625 --> 00:55:42,750
<font size="20">Ya, kau berkeringat.</font>

973
00:55:44,125 --> 00:55:47,083
<font size="20">Terserah. Aku ada urusan penting.</font>

974
00:55:47,166 --> 00:55:49,666
<font size="20">Kalian kerja saja. Aku juga mau kerja.</font>

975
00:55:51,500 --> 00:55:52,375
<font size="20">Aku pergi.</font>

976
00:55:54,041 --> 00:55:56,125
<font size="20">- Kita akan bertemu lagi.
- Ya.</font>

977
00:55:56,750 --> 00:55:58,166
<font size="20">Istrimu di mana?</font>

978
00:55:59,041 --> 00:56:00,625
<font size="20">Tanya saja pengacaranya.</font>

979
00:56:03,750 --> 00:56:06,166
<font size="20">Cerai itu memang mahal, ya?</font>

980
00:56:18,708 --> 00:56:21,250
<font size="20">Sepertinya algoritmaku akurat,</font>

981
00:56:21,333 --> 00:56:23,250
<font size="20">menimbang kemacetan kecepatan mobilku…</font>

982
00:56:23,333 --> 00:56:24,416
<font size="20">Ibrahim!</font>

983
00:56:24,500 --> 00:56:29,250
<font size="20">Apakah Ian Ventham sempat
membunuh Tony Curran? Ya atau tidak?</font>

984
00:56:29,333 --> 00:56:30,250
<font size="20">Tidak.</font>

985
00:56:31,250 --> 00:56:32,083
<font size="20">Waduh.</font>

986
00:56:32,750 --> 00:56:33,791
<font size="20">- Waduh.
- Waduh.</font>

987
00:56:33,875 --> 00:56:34,708
<font size="20">Waduh juga.</font>

988
00:56:37,583 --> 00:56:38,416
<font size="20">Pak?</font>

989
00:56:39,583 --> 00:56:41,708
<font size="20">Mustahil Ian Ventham membunuhnya.</font>

990
00:56:42,791 --> 00:56:43,625
<font size="20">Apa?</font>

991
00:56:44,708 --> 00:56:45,625
<font size="20">Kenapa?</font>

992
00:56:45,708 --> 00:56:47,791
<font size="20">Dia tak akan sempat ke rumah Tony.</font>

993
00:56:47,875 --> 00:56:50,708
<font size="20">Pasti telat tujuh menit
dari waktu kematian.</font>

994
00:56:50,791 --> 00:56:53,750
<font size="20">- Dan kau tahu dari…
- Thursday Murder Club.</font>

995
00:56:54,875 --> 00:56:56,625
<font size="20">Klub apa?</font>

996
00:56:57,625 --> 00:57:00,583
<font size="20">Itu nama klub mereka.</font>

997
00:57:01,500 --> 00:57:02,916
<font size="20">Elizabeth dan teman-temannya.</font>

998
00:57:03,000 --> 00:57:06,125
<font size="20">Mereka menguji rute ke rumah Curran,
dan waktunya memang tak cukup.</font>

999
00:57:06,625 --> 00:57:10,166
<font size="20">Griffiths juga sedang menghitungnya.</font>

1000
00:57:10,250 --> 00:57:11,875
<font size="20">Astaga, kacau.</font>

1001
00:57:12,541 --> 00:57:14,916
<font size="20">Hampir 30 tahun aku menjadi polisi.</font>

1002
00:57:15,000 --> 00:57:17,708
<font size="20">Aku tidak sudi disetir empat pensiunan.</font>

1003
00:57:17,791 --> 00:57:20,875
<font size="20">- Griffiths, pas sekali. Bagaimana?
- Berdasarkan temuan…</font>

1004
00:57:20,958 --> 00:57:23,041
<font size="20">Sudah, langsung saja.</font>

1005
00:57:23,541 --> 00:57:27,666
<font size="20">Sempatkah Ventham
membunuh Curran? Ya atau tidak.</font>

1006
00:57:28,458 --> 00:57:30,791
<font size="20">- Tidak.
- Pergi kau, Griffiths.</font>

1007
00:57:47,208 --> 00:57:49,416
<font size="20">- Halo, Donna.
- Hai, Elizabeth.</font>

1008
00:57:49,958 --> 00:57:51,750
<font size="20">- Aku butuh bantuan.
- Apa?</font>

1009
00:57:51,833 --> 00:57:56,208
<font size="20">Di TKP, kami menemukan
foto Curran bersama Bobby Tanner.</font>

1010
00:57:57,708 --> 00:57:58,583
<font size="20">Bobby Tanner?</font>

1011
00:57:59,208 --> 00:58:01,416
<font size="20">Aku tahu dia. Orang yang bengis.</font>

1012
00:58:01,916 --> 00:58:03,708
<font size="20">Terlibat narkoba dan pembunuhan.</font>

1013
00:58:04,375 --> 00:58:05,208
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1014
00:58:05,875 --> 00:58:09,833
<font size="20">Kami perlu keterangannya,
tapi dia sudah lama menghilang.</font>

1015
00:58:09,916 --> 00:58:11,916
<font size="20">Apa kau bisa bantu mencarinya?</font>

1016
00:58:12,500 --> 00:58:13,625
<font size="20">Tentu bisa.</font>

1017
00:58:14,166 --> 00:58:17,208
<font size="20">Asal kau berbagi informasi terbaru.</font>

1018
00:58:17,750 --> 00:58:18,875
<font size="20">Elizabeth.</font>

1019
00:58:18,958 --> 00:58:22,375
<font size="20">Ayolah, Donna. Harus ada timbal balik.</font>

1020
00:58:25,333 --> 00:58:29,125
<font size="20">Ingat foto yang kuceritakan?
Ada pria ketiga di foto itu.</font>

1021
00:58:29,208 --> 00:58:30,791
<font size="20">Ingat. Siapa?</font>

1022
00:58:31,416 --> 00:58:32,458
<font size="20">Jason Ritchie.</font>

1023
00:58:34,625 --> 00:58:35,458
<font size="20">Apa?</font>

1024
00:58:36,458 --> 00:58:37,541
<font size="20">Satu hal lagi.</font>

1025
00:58:40,708 --> 00:58:42,250
<font size="20">Sambung lagi nanti.</font>

1026
00:59:04,916 --> 00:59:06,833
<font size="20">Jangan mengusik yang sudah mati.</font>

1027
00:59:12,041 --> 00:59:13,250
<font size="20">Astaga.</font>

1028
00:59:13,333 --> 00:59:15,458
<font size="20">- Wajahnya terlihat?
- Terlalu gelap.</font>

1029
00:59:16,416 --> 00:59:20,041
<font size="20">Meski Ian Ventham
bukan lagi tersangka utama,</font>

1030
00:59:20,125 --> 00:59:22,958
<font size="20">bisa saja dia menyewa pembunuh.</font>

1031
00:59:23,041 --> 00:59:25,833
<font size="20">Benar, justru di situ gilanya.</font>

1032
00:59:25,916 --> 00:59:28,708
<font size="20">Polisi akan memeriksa Jason.</font>

1033
00:59:29,250 --> 00:59:32,416
<font size="20">Kabarnya, dulu Jason sering disewa</font>

1034
00:59:32,500 --> 00:59:36,333
<font size="20">Ventham dan Tony Curran
untuk pasang badan.</font>

1035
00:59:36,416 --> 00:59:39,375
<font size="20">- Seperti apa contohnya?
- Masih kami cari tahu.</font>

1036
00:59:39,458 --> 00:59:40,833
<font size="20">Ron belum tahu.</font>

1037
00:59:40,916 --> 00:59:44,458
<font size="20">Untung dia sibuk
mengatur aksi warga kompleks.</font>

1038
00:59:44,541 --> 00:59:47,500
<font size="20">Oh, omong-omong, aku harus pergi.</font>

1039
00:59:48,125 --> 00:59:51,791
<font size="20">Mau kujemput Senin nanti?
Kita ke titik aksi bersama.</font>

1040
00:59:51,875 --> 00:59:53,083
<font size="20">Tentu aku mau.</font>

1041
00:59:53,583 --> 00:59:55,916
<font size="20">Mereka tak boleh membongkar pemakaman</font>

1042
00:59:56,000 --> 00:59:59,333
<font size="20">dan menelantarkan Penny begitu saja.
Harus dihentikan.</font>

1043
00:59:59,416 --> 01:00:00,458
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1044
01:00:00,541 --> 01:00:02,666
<font size="20">Senin nanti, kita lawan mereka.</font>

1045
01:00:05,416 --> 01:00:09,541
<font size="20">Semuanya, ayo merapat!</font>

1046
01:00:09,625 --> 01:00:14,291
<font size="20">Mari bentuk pagar betis
di depan pemakaman.</font>

1047
01:00:14,375 --> 01:00:18,541
<font size="20">Mari tunjukkan solidaritas kita. Setuju?</font>

1048
01:00:19,250 --> 01:00:20,166
<font size="20">Ya!</font>

1049
01:00:20,250 --> 01:00:21,791
<font size="20">Mari berjuang.</font>

1050
01:00:21,875 --> 01:00:22,750
<font size="20">Ya, bagus.</font>

1051
01:00:23,500 --> 01:00:24,416
<font size="20">Tetap semangat.</font>

1052
01:00:24,500 --> 01:00:26,250
<font size="20">TOLAK IAN
STOP PENGUASAAN TANAH</font>

1053
01:00:26,333 --> 01:00:28,083
<font size="20">Jangan sampai kita menyerah.</font>

1054
01:00:28,166 --> 01:00:30,541
<font size="20">- Setuju.
- Maju terus, pantang mundur.</font>

1055
01:00:30,625 --> 01:00:33,791
<font size="20">- Terima kasih sudah bergabung.
- Kita hentikan Ian!</font>

1056
01:00:33,875 --> 01:00:35,750
<font size="20">Wah, kalian juga datang. Bagus.</font>

1057
01:00:35,833 --> 01:00:38,541
<font size="20">Bernard memakai poster lama.
Aku membuat baru.</font>

1058
01:00:38,625 --> 01:00:41,458
<font size="20">Pokoknya, jangan berselisih, ya.</font>

1059
01:00:41,541 --> 01:00:43,750
<font size="20">- Kita harus solider.
- Setuju.</font>

1060
01:00:44,333 --> 01:00:45,833
<font size="20">Mantap, Ibsy. Mantap.</font>

1061
01:00:46,333 --> 01:00:49,000
<font size="20">Kenapa bawa mesin kopi?</font>

1062
01:00:49,083 --> 01:00:51,583
<font size="20">Ini bukan bazar. Kita serius berjuang.</font>

1063
01:00:51,666 --> 01:00:55,208
<font size="20">Ya, tapi dengan kopi enak,
bisa berdemo lebih lama.</font>

1064
01:00:56,083 --> 01:00:58,083
<font size="20">Sungguh wanita bijaksana.</font>

1065
01:01:02,458 --> 01:01:05,083
<font size="20">Musuh mendekat!</font>

1066
01:01:06,083 --> 01:01:09,375
<font size="20">Astaga. Yang benar saja! Dasar pengganggu!</font>

1067
01:01:11,458 --> 01:01:13,791
<font size="20">Bawa sekop,
masuk gerbang belakang, mulai gali.</font>

1068
01:01:13,875 --> 01:01:16,250
<font size="20">Kapan selesainya kalau pakai sekop?</font>

1069
01:01:16,333 --> 01:01:18,708
<font size="20">Secara hukum, proyek dimulai hari ini.</font>

1070
01:01:18,791 --> 01:01:21,125
<font size="20">Kau cukup mulai menggali. Turun.</font>

1071
01:01:21,208 --> 01:01:22,208
<font size="20">Oke.</font>

1072
01:01:30,000 --> 01:01:31,750
<font size="20">Jangan halangi jalan!</font>

1073
01:01:34,000 --> 01:01:36,958
<font size="20">Di situ. Ya. Awas.</font>

1074
01:01:37,041 --> 01:01:39,125
<font size="20">Seperti dikerumuni zombi.</font>

1075
01:01:40,291 --> 01:01:41,291
<font size="20">Terus.</font>

1076
01:01:41,375 --> 01:01:45,125
<font size="20">Awas. Tetap bertahan.
Jangan goyah. Ya, begitu.</font>

1077
01:01:45,625 --> 01:01:46,458
<font size="20">Bagus.</font>

1078
01:01:46,541 --> 01:01:48,000
<font size="20">Apa-apaan ini?</font>

1079
01:01:49,833 --> 01:01:54,041
<font size="20">Apa ini? Nostalgia jadi aktivis, ya?
Saat kau masih bisa ereksi?</font>

1080
01:01:54,125 --> 01:01:56,791
<font size="20">Menurutmu ini apa? Aksi!</font>

1081
01:01:57,416 --> 01:02:00,958
<font size="20">Mereka ini pernah menyingkirkan lawan
yang lebih kuat darimu.</font>

1082
01:02:01,041 --> 01:02:05,375
<font size="20">Ada pensiunan guru,
prajurit, dokter, dan bankir.</font>

1083
01:02:06,250 --> 01:02:07,791
<font size="20">Apa tuntutan kita?</font>

1084
01:02:07,875 --> 01:02:11,500
<font size="20">- Stop penggusuran!
- Perbesar tulisan di menu!</font>

1085
01:02:12,416 --> 01:02:15,000
<font size="20">Model telanjang untuk kelas seni.</font>

1086
01:02:15,083 --> 01:02:18,750
<font size="20">Tunggu. Jangan teriakkan
permintaan pribadi.</font>

1087
01:02:18,833 --> 01:02:20,666
<font size="20">Jangan! Kita harus solider!</font>

1088
01:02:20,750 --> 01:02:24,083
<font size="20">Semua menyingkir. Kami mau mulai menggali.</font>

1089
01:02:24,166 --> 01:02:28,041
<font size="20">- Kau tak boleh masuk!
- Jangan sentuh dia, Ventham.</font>

1090
01:02:28,125 --> 01:02:30,708
<font size="20">Enyahlah, Pengkhianat. Aku tahu niatmu.</font>

1091
01:02:30,791 --> 01:02:34,333
<font size="20">Begitu? Langkahi dulu aku
dan mereka jika ingin masuk.</font>

1092
01:02:34,416 --> 01:02:37,166
<font size="20">Usir Ian Ventham!</font>

1093
01:02:37,791 --> 01:02:41,208
<font size="20">Usir Ian Ventham!</font>

1094
01:02:41,291 --> 01:02:42,125
<font size="20">Terus!</font>

1095
01:02:43,000 --> 01:02:46,541
<font size="20">Usir Ian Ventham!</font>

1096
01:02:46,625 --> 01:02:47,875
<font size="20">Solidaritas.</font>

1097
01:02:48,750 --> 01:02:51,875
<font size="20">Usir Ian Ventham!</font>

1098
01:02:52,916 --> 01:02:57,083
<font size="20">Tetap solid, Teman-Teman.
Teriakkan yang lantang.</font>

1099
01:02:57,875 --> 01:03:00,000
<font size="20">- Usir Ian Ventham!
- Aku lapor polisi.</font>

1100
01:03:00,083 --> 01:03:02,375
<font size="20">Silakan! Tadi kau menyerang pastur.</font>

1101
01:03:03,208 --> 01:03:04,541
<font size="20">Usir Ian Ventham!</font>

1102
01:03:05,833 --> 01:03:06,708
<font size="20">Halo.</font>

1103
01:03:08,875 --> 01:03:10,958
<font size="20">Kau lihat burung pelatuk?</font>

1104
01:03:11,041 --> 01:03:13,458
<font size="20">Sepertinya tadi lewat sini.</font>

1105
01:03:14,416 --> 01:03:15,250
<font size="20">Tidak.</font>

1106
01:03:17,166 --> 01:03:20,375
<font size="20">Kau sering melakukan perbaikan
di sekitar sini, 'kan?</font>

1107
01:03:20,458 --> 01:03:22,250
<font size="20">Namamu Bogdan, ya?</font>

1108
01:03:23,541 --> 01:03:24,375
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1109
01:03:29,833 --> 01:03:30,666
<font size="20">Aku Marina.</font>

1110
01:03:34,875 --> 01:03:36,416
<font size="20">Mirip nama ibuku.</font>

1111
01:03:36,500 --> 01:03:37,583
<font size="20">Masa?</font>

1112
01:03:37,666 --> 01:03:40,458
<font size="20">Sungguh? Kebetulan sekali, ya?</font>

1113
01:03:40,541 --> 01:03:44,000
<font size="20">Namanya cantik.
Tentu aku memuji nama sendiri, ya?</font>

1114
01:03:44,958 --> 01:03:48,791
<font size="20">- Dia ikut bersamamu di sini?
- Tidak. Ibu masih di Polandia.</font>

1115
01:03:51,208 --> 01:03:54,333
<font size="20">Kau pasti merindukannya.</font>

1116
01:03:55,500 --> 01:03:57,083
<font size="20">Dia juga merindukanmu.</font>

1117
01:03:59,791 --> 01:04:02,791
<font size="20">Tiap hari aku merindukannya.</font>

1118
01:04:05,291 --> 01:04:08,041
<font size="20">- Kau bisa bahasa Polandia?
- Ya, sedikit.</font>

1119
01:04:09,791 --> 01:04:11,750
<font size="20">Aku merantau ke Inggris karena ibuku.</font>

1120
01:04:11,833 --> 01:04:15,666
<font size="20">Pekerjaan di sini lebih menjanjikan
dan bayarannya lebih besar.</font>

1121
01:04:16,208 --> 01:04:18,416
<font size="20">Yang penting kirim uang ke rumah.</font>

1122
01:04:18,916 --> 01:04:20,625
<font size="20">Asalmu daerah mana?</font>

1123
01:04:20,708 --> 01:04:21,583
<font size="20">Kraków.</font>

1124
01:04:21,666 --> 01:04:26,625
<font size="20">Aku pernah makan sup
yang lezat sekali di Kraków. Krupnik.</font>

1125
01:04:26,708 --> 01:04:28,958
<font size="20">- Itu sup jelai.
- Ya.</font>

1126
01:04:29,666 --> 01:04:31,500
<font size="20">Ada keperluan apa di Polandia?</font>

1127
01:04:32,375 --> 01:04:33,500
<font size="20">Sirkus keliling.</font>

1128
01:04:34,375 --> 01:04:36,125
<font size="20">Itu masa-masa indah.</font>

1129
01:04:36,625 --> 01:04:37,458
<font size="20">Baiklah.</font>

1130
01:04:38,708 --> 01:04:39,916
<font size="20">Ini konyol, ya?</font>

1131
01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:43,333
<font size="20">Pekerjaan ini tanggung jawabku,
tapi aku cuma bawa sekop.</font>

1132
01:04:43,416 --> 01:04:45,833
<font size="20">Kau jadi mandor menggantikan Tony?</font>

1133
01:04:45,916 --> 01:04:49,625
<font size="20">Ya, sekarang aku kontraktor utama Ian.</font>

1134
01:04:51,958 --> 01:04:54,916
<font size="20">Ian memberimu pekerjaan itu
sebelum Tony meninggal?</font>

1135
01:04:56,333 --> 01:05:01,250
<font size="20">Ya, Marina, aku diberi pekerjaan ini
sebelum Tony meninggal. Kenapa?</font>

1136
01:05:01,916 --> 01:05:04,666
<font size="20">Kau ingin tahu sesuatu?</font>

1137
01:05:06,541 --> 01:05:09,750
<font size="20">Ian sangat diuntungkan
dengan kematian Tony,</font>

1138
01:05:09,833 --> 01:05:13,333
<font size="20">jadi aku penasaran apa dia</font>

1139
01:05:14,208 --> 01:05:17,333
<font size="20">menyuruh seseorang untuk membunuh Tony?</font>

1140
01:05:19,458 --> 01:05:20,500
<font size="20">Entahlah.</font>

1141
01:05:21,916 --> 01:05:22,833
<font size="20">Bisa jadi.</font>

1142
01:05:25,250 --> 01:05:27,333
<font size="20">Kalau begitu, aku blak-blakan saja.</font>

1143
01:05:28,541 --> 01:05:31,458
<font size="20">Apa Ian menyuruhmu membunuh Tony?</font>

1144
01:05:33,583 --> 01:05:34,416
<font size="20">Tidak.</font>

1145
01:05:35,666 --> 01:05:38,791
<font size="20">Sekalipun disuruh, akan kutolak.</font>

1146
01:05:39,708 --> 01:05:43,583
<font size="20">Aku siap mengerjakan apa pun
untuk Ian. Menggali mayat, misalnya.</font>

1147
01:05:44,166 --> 01:05:46,291
<font size="20">Tapi aku tak sudi membunuh orang.</font>

1148
01:05:51,708 --> 01:05:54,250
<font size="20">Kau tak diterima di sini, Ian.
Pulang saja!</font>

1149
01:05:54,333 --> 01:05:56,916
<font size="20">Baca spanduknya dan pergilah.</font>

1150
01:05:59,083 --> 01:06:00,666
<font size="20">Jangan sentuh aku. Stop.</font>

1151
01:06:02,250 --> 01:06:03,375
<font size="20">Lepaskan aku!</font>

1152
01:06:05,625 --> 01:06:07,750
<font size="20">Lepaskan aku! Hentikan!</font>

1153
01:06:08,833 --> 01:06:09,916
<font size="20">Jangan sentuh aku!</font>

1154
01:06:11,291 --> 01:06:13,250
<font size="20">- Hei!
- Pergi kau!</font>

1155
01:06:13,333 --> 01:06:15,875
<font size="20">Kenapa kau tak mau mendengarkan kami?</font>

1156
01:06:16,375 --> 01:06:17,791
<font size="20">- Hei!
- Kenapa?</font>

1157
01:06:19,416 --> 01:06:20,625
<font size="20">Tidak! Ini…</font>

1158
01:06:23,791 --> 01:06:24,625
<font size="20">Ini…</font>

1159
01:06:26,375 --> 01:06:28,333
<font size="20">Minggir.</font>

1160
01:06:47,416 --> 01:06:48,583
<font size="20">Dia meninggal.</font>

1161
01:06:54,250 --> 01:06:55,083
<font size="20">Astaga.</font>

1162
01:07:14,208 --> 01:07:15,041
<font size="20">Jadi,</font>

1163
01:07:15,875 --> 01:07:18,000
<font size="20">kita semua saksi kasus pembunuhan.</font>

1164
01:07:20,541 --> 01:07:21,958
<font size="20">Pertanyaan pertama.</font>

1165
01:07:22,041 --> 01:07:24,625
<font size="20">Tahu dari mana itu pembunuhan
dan bukan serangan jantung?</font>

1166
01:07:24,708 --> 01:07:26,250
<font size="20">- Dia jelas tertekan.
- Ya.</font>

1167
01:07:26,333 --> 01:07:29,166
<font size="20">Kematiannya diduga
akibat overdosis fentanil</font>

1168
01:07:29,250 --> 01:07:31,500
<font size="20">yang diberikan sebelum dia mati.</font>

1169
01:07:31,583 --> 01:07:33,666
<font size="20">Polisi menunggu hasil lab.</font>

1170
01:07:33,750 --> 01:07:37,166
<font size="20">- Kau tahu dari mana?
- Donna mengabariku.</font>

1171
01:07:37,666 --> 01:07:41,250
<font size="20">- Dia sangat membantu.
- Fentanil bisa didapat di mana?</font>

1172
01:07:41,333 --> 01:07:44,750
<font size="20">Biasanya dipakai dokter
sebagai anestesi dan pereda nyeri.</font>

1173
01:07:44,833 --> 01:07:46,916
<font size="20">Ampuh di banyak situasi.</font>

1174
01:07:47,416 --> 01:07:51,041
<font size="20">Tapi dalam dosis tinggi bisa fatal.</font>

1175
01:07:51,125 --> 01:07:55,625
<font size="20">Berarti pelakunya mudah mengakses
jarum suntik dan obat-obatan.</font>

1176
01:07:55,708 --> 01:07:59,125
<font size="20">Itu hampir semua warga Coopers Chase, Ron.</font>

1177
01:07:59,208 --> 01:08:02,166
<font size="20">Aku mengumpulkan foto
dari semua saksi di TKP.</font>

1178
01:08:02,250 --> 01:08:04,750
<font size="20">Dugaanku, pembunuhan terjadi
saat dorong-dorongan.</font>

1179
01:08:04,833 --> 01:08:10,083
<font size="20">Fentanil disuntikkan diam-diam
saat semua ricuh.</font>

1180
01:08:10,166 --> 01:08:13,083
<font size="20">- Pembunuhnya di foto ini?
- Itu sudah pasti.</font>

1181
01:08:13,666 --> 01:08:15,291
<font size="20">Kita semua ada di foto.</font>

1182
01:08:15,375 --> 01:08:16,791
<font size="20">Kita semua tersangka.</font>

1183
01:08:28,750 --> 01:08:32,208
<font size="20">Teka-teki tentang Bobby Tanner
juga belum terjawab.</font>

1184
01:08:32,291 --> 01:08:33,125
<font size="20">Apa itu?</font>

1185
01:08:33,708 --> 01:08:34,916
<font size="20">- Siapa?
- Apa?</font>

1186
01:08:35,458 --> 01:08:39,625
<font size="20">- Maaf, aku belum cerita?
- Belum.</font>

1187
01:08:39,708 --> 01:08:44,541
<font size="20">Donna bilang polisi menemukan foto
di lokasi pembunuhan Tony Curran.</font>

1188
01:08:44,625 --> 01:08:49,083
<font size="20">Di foto itu, ada Tony, gembong kriminal
bernama Bobby Tanner, dan Ja…</font>

1189
01:08:52,791 --> 01:08:53,666
<font size="20">Dan siapa?</font>

1190
01:08:54,666 --> 01:08:57,708
<font size="20">- Tak penting. Ini tak…
- Jangan begitu.</font>

1191
01:08:57,791 --> 01:09:01,625
<font size="20">Jangan ditutupi dari kami.
Elizabeth, kita satu tim.</font>

1192
01:09:01,708 --> 01:09:03,666
<font size="20">Tidak kututupi. Aku hanya…</font>

1193
01:09:04,208 --> 01:09:06,541
<font size="20">Kadang Donna menghubungi saat malam.</font>

1194
01:09:06,625 --> 01:09:09,000
<font size="20">Jadi, aku menunggu waktu
yang tepat untuk bilang.</font>

1195
01:09:09,083 --> 01:09:13,708
<font size="20">Sekarang waktu yang tepat
untuk memberi tahu kami.</font>

1196
01:09:15,125 --> 01:09:16,250
<font size="20">Saat ini,</font>

1197
01:09:16,333 --> 01:09:19,541
<font size="20">polisi mencari Bobby Tanner.
Kita juga harus bergerak.</font>

1198
01:09:19,625 --> 01:09:23,041
<font size="20">Bobby Tanner juga pemilik Coopers Chase
bersama Ian Ventham</font>

1199
01:09:23,125 --> 01:09:24,125
<font size="20">dan Tony Curran.</font>

1200
01:09:24,208 --> 01:09:27,333
<font size="20">Di surat wasiat Ian Ventham tertulis</font>

1201
01:09:27,416 --> 01:09:31,708
<font size="20">pengembangan Coopers Chase
akan diteruskan meski Ian meninggal.</font>

1202
01:09:31,791 --> 01:09:35,750
<font size="20">Hanya Bobby Tanner yang bisa mencegah,
tapi dia entah di mana.</font>

1203
01:09:35,833 --> 01:09:38,708
<font size="20">Perjuangan melindungi
rumah kita belum tuntas.</font>

1204
01:09:39,583 --> 01:09:42,916
<font size="20">Sudah mati pun,
Ian masih bikin kita susah.</font>

1205
01:09:43,500 --> 01:09:47,333
<font size="20">Berarti pemilik Coopers Chase
yang masih hidup hanya Bobby Tanner?</font>

1206
01:09:47,416 --> 01:09:49,666
<font size="20">Ya, tampaknya begitu.</font>

1207
01:09:49,750 --> 01:09:51,875
<font size="20">Tapi bisa juga dia sudah mati.</font>

1208
01:09:51,958 --> 01:09:54,875
<font size="20">Jika dia ditemukan,
pengembangan bisa dihentikan?</font>

1209
01:09:54,958 --> 01:09:57,125
<font size="20">Dan Coopers Chase aman?</font>

1210
01:09:57,208 --> 01:10:01,041
<font size="20">- Pemakaman juga tidak dibongkar?
- Ya. Mari mulai mencari.</font>

1211
01:10:01,125 --> 01:10:04,583
<font size="20">Ya, ada kelas merajut juga
di ruangan ini sejam lagi.</font>

1212
01:10:04,666 --> 01:10:05,500
<font size="20">Oke.</font>

1213
01:10:06,000 --> 01:10:07,416
<font size="20">Sejak kapan mulai main?</font>

1214
01:10:07,500 --> 01:10:13,500
<font size="20">Diajari Ayah waktu umurku 10.
Baru bisa mengalahkan Ayah di umur 13.</font>

1215
01:10:15,375 --> 01:10:18,458
<font size="20">- Ayah tak mau mengalah.
- Itu mengagumkan.</font>

1216
01:10:18,541 --> 01:10:19,958
<font size="20">- Ya.
- Sekakmat.</font>

1217
01:10:20,041 --> 01:10:21,708
<font size="20">Oh, bukan main.</font>

1218
01:10:21,791 --> 01:10:23,416
<font size="20">Wah, Elizabeth.</font>

1219
01:10:23,500 --> 01:10:25,541
<font size="20">Pemuda ini mencarimu.</font>

1220
01:10:25,625 --> 01:10:27,458
<font size="20">Dia bisa bermain catur.</font>

1221
01:10:28,250 --> 01:10:30,208
<font size="20">Jago sekali pula.</font>

1222
01:10:31,125 --> 01:10:33,833
<font size="20">Wi-Fi di ruang bacaku juga dia perbaiki.</font>

1223
01:10:34,458 --> 01:10:37,125
<font size="20">Bogdan, tak kusangka kau kemari.</font>

1224
01:10:37,708 --> 01:10:40,583
<font size="20">Maaf mengganggu, Elizabeth.</font>

1225
01:10:42,666 --> 01:10:44,541
<font size="20">Jangan sungkan. Selamat datang.</font>

1226
01:10:46,125 --> 01:10:48,125
<font size="20">Terima kasih, Stephen. Aku harus pamit.</font>

1227
01:10:48,208 --> 01:10:50,000
<font size="20">- Sama-sama.
- Aku pulang dulu.</font>

1228
01:10:50,083 --> 01:10:51,083
<font size="20">Aku antar keluar.</font>

1229
01:10:51,166 --> 01:10:53,583
<font size="20">- Elizabeth.
- Ada perlu apa?</font>

1230
01:10:53,666 --> 01:10:56,833
<font size="20">Aku ingin bicara. Posisiku buntu.</font>

1231
01:10:56,916 --> 01:11:01,083
<font size="20">Polisi minta alibiku. Aku bersama Marina
di pemakaman saat Ian dibunuh.</font>

1232
01:11:01,166 --> 01:11:04,000
<font size="20">Tapi katanya tak ada
yang bernama Marina di sini.</font>

1233
01:11:04,083 --> 01:11:08,666
<font size="20">Jadi, aku berkeliling mencari
perempuan yang banyak bertanya.</font>

1234
01:11:08,750 --> 01:11:10,458
<font size="20">Semua langsung menunjukmu.</font>

1235
01:11:10,541 --> 01:11:12,375
<font size="20">Baiklah. Kau benar.</font>

1236
01:11:13,083 --> 01:11:15,625
<font size="20">Aku ingin bicara denganmu
dan kukira memakai nama itu</font>

1237
01:11:15,708 --> 01:11:18,125
<font size="20">bisa lebih membuka hatimu.</font>

1238
01:11:18,208 --> 01:11:19,875
<font size="20">Trik murahan.</font>

1239
01:11:19,958 --> 01:11:22,541
<font size="20">Memang. Sudah kebiasaan. Maafkan aku.</font>

1240
01:11:26,416 --> 01:11:27,916
<font size="20">Jadi, kenapa kau kemari?</font>

1241
01:11:29,125 --> 01:11:31,000
<font size="20">Aku ingin menunjukkan sesuatu.</font>

1242
01:11:31,583 --> 01:11:33,000
<font size="20">Malam ini.</font>

1243
01:11:33,083 --> 01:11:34,791
<font size="20">Setelah petang.</font>

1244
01:11:35,291 --> 01:11:38,375
<font size="20">Temui aku di pemakaman.
Jangan ajak siapa pun.</font>

1245
01:11:39,250 --> 01:11:41,791
<font size="20">Datanglah sendirian. Kumohon.</font>

1246
01:11:43,500 --> 01:11:44,750
<font size="20">Aku janji.</font>

1247
01:11:46,416 --> 01:11:47,250
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

1248
01:11:51,833 --> 01:11:55,416
<font size="20">Siap-siap. Berputar.
Ke posisi. Busungkan dada.</font>

1249
01:11:55,500 --> 01:12:00,666
<font size="20">Kiri, kanan. Tahan.</font>

1250
01:12:00,750 --> 01:12:04,875
<font size="20">Putaran terakhir. Atas. Kiri. Bagus.</font>

1251
01:12:07,916 --> 01:12:08,750
<font size="20">Itu dia.</font>

1252
01:12:11,000 --> 01:12:11,875
<font size="20">Beri hormat.</font>

1253
01:12:11,958 --> 01:12:13,541
<font size="20">- Beri hormat.
- Sempurna.</font>

1254
01:12:17,166 --> 01:12:19,791
<font size="20">Jadi, ada urusan apa?</font>

1255
01:12:20,291 --> 01:12:22,791
<font size="20">Sudah kuceritakan semuanya.</font>

1256
01:12:23,291 --> 01:12:26,958
<font size="20">Aku di gym bersama temanku,
Dan Fairhurst, saat Tony tewas.</font>

1257
01:12:27,041 --> 01:12:30,250
<font size="20">Itu sebelum Curran tewas,
bukan saat dia tewas.</font>

1258
01:12:30,333 --> 01:12:32,333
<font size="20">- Paham perbedaannya?
- Ya.</font>

1259
01:12:33,000 --> 01:12:35,458
<font size="20">Petugas kebersihan menemukannya.
Mungkin dia pelakunya.</font>

1260
01:12:36,291 --> 01:12:37,833
<font size="20">Menurutku begini.</font>

1261
01:12:38,333 --> 01:12:41,333
<font size="20">Pembunuh bukan
yang pertama menemukan jasad korban,</font>

1262
01:12:41,416 --> 01:12:43,416
<font size="20">tapi yang terakhir melihat korban hidup.</font>

1263
01:12:43,500 --> 01:12:45,333
<font size="20">- Keren.
- Dari episode Colombo.</font>

1264
01:12:46,083 --> 01:12:49,583
<font size="20">Lalu, bagaimana? Aku dituduh apa?</font>

1265
01:12:49,666 --> 01:12:54,541
<font size="20">Kenapa Ventham meneleponmu tiga kali
setelah cekcok dengan Tony Curran?</font>

1266
01:12:54,625 --> 01:12:56,458
<font size="20">Apa dia meminta bantuanmu?</font>

1267
01:12:56,541 --> 01:12:59,750
<font size="20">Apa Ventham menyuruhmu membunuh Tony
karena dia takut?</font>

1268
01:12:59,833 --> 01:13:02,583
<font size="20">Tidak, kami membahas hal lain.</font>

1269
01:13:02,666 --> 01:13:04,458
<font size="20">Aku tak percaya, Jason.</font>

1270
01:13:05,041 --> 01:13:08,750
<font size="20">- Kami punya kepentingan lain.
- Ya, aku tahu itu.</font>

1271
01:13:09,375 --> 01:13:11,916
<font size="20">Ventham yang melunasi utang judimu, bukan?</font>

1272
01:13:13,000 --> 01:13:15,458
<font size="20">Karena Ventham melunasi utang judimu,</font>

1273
01:13:15,541 --> 01:13:18,083
<font size="20">kadang kau bekerja untuknya.</font>

1274
01:13:18,166 --> 01:13:22,708
<font size="20">- Apa pun yang dia minta…
- Tidak. Tak semua yang dia minta.</font>

1275
01:13:22,791 --> 01:13:24,875
<font size="20">Kenapa dia meneleponmu, Jason?</font>

1276
01:13:24,958 --> 01:13:26,041
<font size="20">Itu…</font>

1277
01:13:26,750 --> 01:13:28,750
<font size="20">Urusan pribadi. Jelas?</font>

1278
01:13:29,375 --> 01:13:32,875
<font size="20">- Aku harus latihan.
- Kau kenal Bobby Tanner, Jason?</font>

1279
01:13:33,375 --> 01:13:35,250
<font size="20">Apa? Bobby Tanner?</font>

1280
01:13:35,875 --> 01:13:37,166
<font size="20">Dia sudah mati, 'kan?</font>

1281
01:13:39,583 --> 01:13:41,375
<font size="20">Kau ingat foto ini?</font>

1282
01:13:42,791 --> 01:13:43,750
<font size="20">Tidak.</font>

1283
01:13:43,833 --> 01:13:48,000
<font size="20">Bukankah yang di cermin ini lenganmu?</font>

1284
01:13:48,708 --> 01:13:52,250
<font size="20">Kau terlibat
dengan organisasi kriminal, Jason?</font>

1285
01:13:53,208 --> 01:13:56,416
<font size="20">Membunuh pasti enteng bagimu.</font>

1286
01:13:56,958 --> 01:13:59,541
<font size="20">Kenapa tempo hari kau buru-buru pergi?</font>

1287
01:13:59,625 --> 01:14:02,750
<font size="20">- Ingin kabur?
- Aku tak punya waktu meladeni kalian.</font>

1288
01:14:02,833 --> 01:14:06,833
<font size="20">Jason, kau ditangkap
atas dugaan pembunuhan Tony Curran.</font>

1289
01:14:06,916 --> 01:14:09,083
<font size="20">Apa maksudmu? Mana buktinya?</font>

1290
01:14:09,166 --> 01:14:11,416
<font size="20">Kau menolak menjawab dan tak punya alibi.</font>

1291
01:14:11,500 --> 01:14:12,708
<font size="20">Kau mampu dan punya motif.</font>

1292
01:14:12,791 --> 01:14:15,625
<font size="20">Selain itu, kami khawatir kau akan kabur.</font>

1293
01:14:15,708 --> 01:14:19,291
<font size="20">Kau berisiko kabur ke luar negeri.
Jadi, penahanan ini sah.</font>

1294
01:14:19,375 --> 01:14:21,458
<font size="20">Bisa lepas sepatu skating-mu?</font>

1295
01:14:22,833 --> 01:14:23,791
<font size="20">Sial.</font>

1296
01:14:26,333 --> 01:14:28,791
<font size="20">Pembunuhan Tony Curran dan Ian Ventham.</font>

1297
01:14:28,875 --> 01:14:30,833
<font size="20">Pelakunya pasti sama.</font>

1298
01:14:30,916 --> 01:14:34,666
<font size="20">Dua rekan bisnis dibunuh
dalam rentang beberapa hari saja.</font>

1299
01:14:35,166 --> 01:14:38,458
<font size="20">Pelaku pasti ingin menghentikan
pengembangan kompleks.</font>

1300
01:14:38,541 --> 01:14:41,375
<font size="20">Bernard bagaimana?
Dia tampak tegang saat aksi.</font>

1301
01:14:41,458 --> 01:14:43,458
<font size="20">Ya, dia juga pemarah.</font>

1302
01:14:43,541 --> 01:14:47,458
<font size="20">Dia juga ahli kimia.
Paling mungkin punya akses ke zat beracun.</font>

1303
01:14:47,541 --> 01:14:51,458
<font size="20">- Kunilai dia sembilan.
- Terlalu tinggi. Enam.</font>

1304
01:14:51,541 --> 01:14:55,375
<font size="20">- Baiklah. Tujuh.
- Boleh. Kalau Pastur Mackie?</font>

1305
01:14:55,458 --> 01:14:57,625
<font size="20">Emosinya paling meledak-ledak saat aksi.</font>

1306
01:14:58,166 --> 01:15:01,500
<font size="20">- Nilainya 10.
- Ya, belakangan gelagatnya aneh.</font>

1307
01:15:01,583 --> 01:15:03,166
<font size="20">Pastur biasanya tak dicurigai.</font>

1308
01:15:03,250 --> 01:15:05,541
<font size="20">- Mau tambah minum?
- Ya.</font>

1309
01:15:06,375 --> 01:15:07,791
<font size="20">Aku jadi kepikiran.</font>

1310
01:15:08,291 --> 01:15:10,208
<font size="20">Setelah kematian Tony dan Ian,</font>

1311
01:15:11,333 --> 01:15:13,041
<font size="20">apa situasi kita berubah?</font>

1312
01:15:13,125 --> 01:15:15,541
<font size="20">Apa kita masih akan digusur?</font>

1313
01:15:15,625 --> 01:15:18,000
<font size="20">Tergantung Coopers Chase Investment.</font>

1314
01:15:18,083 --> 01:15:21,166
<font size="20">- Bobby Tanner harus ditemukan dulu.
- Ya.</font>

1315
01:15:21,250 --> 01:15:24,208
<font size="20">- Jangan di atas buku.
- Maaf.</font>

1316
01:15:25,250 --> 01:15:26,083
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

1317
01:15:31,208 --> 01:15:33,833
<font size="20">- Aku akan rindu tempat ini.
- Ya.</font>

1318
01:15:34,833 --> 01:15:37,708
<font size="20">Di sini, jika ingin sendiri,
cukup tutup pintu.</font>

1319
01:15:38,208 --> 01:15:40,208
<font size="20">Jika ingin ditemani, buka saja.</font>

1320
01:15:40,291 --> 01:15:42,125
<font size="20">Sesederhana itu untuk bahagia.</font>

1321
01:15:42,208 --> 01:15:46,708
<font size="20">Mirip kampusku di Oxford, tapi di sini
makanannya enak dan suasananya hangat.</font>

1322
01:15:48,666 --> 01:15:50,833
<font size="20">Ada telepon. Halo?</font>

1323
01:15:50,916 --> 01:15:53,541
<font size="20">Halo? Maaf, ya.</font>

1324
01:15:57,375 --> 01:15:58,458
<font size="20">Halo? Ya.</font>

1325
01:16:01,125 --> 01:16:01,958
<font size="20">Apa?</font>

1326
01:16:03,416 --> 01:16:04,500
<font size="20">Baiklah.</font>

1327
01:16:04,583 --> 01:16:07,875
<font size="20">Dengar, jangan dijawab. Diam saja.</font>

1328
01:16:07,958 --> 01:16:12,000
<font size="20">Pasti bisa kita lewati.
Jangan bicara. Sampai nanti.</font>

1329
01:16:13,958 --> 01:16:15,125
<font size="20">Itu dari Jason.</font>

1330
01:16:16,375 --> 01:16:18,666
<font size="20">Dia ditahan karena membunuh Tony.</font>

1331
01:16:18,750 --> 01:16:19,875
<font size="20">Astaga.</font>

1332
01:16:20,375 --> 01:16:21,375
<font size="20">Bisa-bisanya.</font>

1333
01:16:22,833 --> 01:16:24,916
<font size="20">- Lewat sini?
- Ya, lewat sini.</font>

1334
01:16:25,458 --> 01:16:28,500
<font size="20">Suamimu, Stephen, tidak sehat, ya?</font>

1335
01:16:28,583 --> 01:16:30,625
<font size="20">Ya, begitulah.</font>

1336
01:16:32,375 --> 01:16:34,375
<font size="20">Obatnya dicampur ke tehnya?</font>

1337
01:16:35,625 --> 01:16:36,458
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1338
01:16:37,000 --> 01:16:38,583
<font size="20">Obat tidur.</font>

1339
01:16:39,708 --> 01:16:42,333
<font size="20">Sebutir cukup. Lebih dari itu bisa fatal.</font>

1340
01:16:43,666 --> 01:16:46,416
<font size="20">Terima kasih sudah bermain catur
dengannya.</font>

1341
01:16:46,500 --> 01:16:50,291
<font size="20">Sudah lama Stephen
tak punya teman main catur.</font>

1342
01:16:50,375 --> 01:16:52,083
<font size="20">Dia jago.</font>

1343
01:16:52,166 --> 01:16:55,041
<font size="20">- Lawan yang sulit.
- Maukah kau datang lagi?</font>

1344
01:16:55,125 --> 01:16:59,125
<font size="20">Mau sekali. Di sini temanku tak banyak.</font>

1345
01:16:59,208 --> 01:17:02,500
<font size="20">Tapi kondisi Stephen tak selalu stabil.</font>

1346
01:17:02,583 --> 01:17:05,541
<font size="20">- Kebetulan tadi dia sehat.
- Ibuku juga sama.</font>

1347
01:17:06,041 --> 01:17:08,541
<font size="20">Ibuku kadang tak ingat aku.</font>

1348
01:17:10,166 --> 01:17:11,333
<font size="20">Beliau sakit parah.</font>

1349
01:17:12,166 --> 01:17:15,666
<font size="20">Entah berapa lama lagi aku bisa…</font>

1350
01:17:16,958 --> 01:17:20,333
<font size="20">Bogdan, aku turut prihatin.
Pulang dan tengoklah ibumu.</font>

1351
01:17:22,500 --> 01:17:26,500
<font size="20">Aku juga ingin pulang menengoknya,
sekali saja, tapi tak bisa.</font>

1352
01:17:26,583 --> 01:17:27,833
<font size="20">Kenapa?</font>

1353
01:17:29,125 --> 01:17:31,541
<font size="20">Saat pekerja sepertiku datang ke Inggris,</font>

1354
01:17:31,625 --> 01:17:34,958
<font size="20">paspor kami ditahan sebagai jaminan.</font>

1355
01:17:35,041 --> 01:17:37,875
<font size="20">Kata mereka, ini prosedur standar.</font>

1356
01:17:39,208 --> 01:17:40,541
<font size="20">Siapa "mereka"?</font>

1357
01:17:43,125 --> 01:17:45,708
<font size="20">Lupakan. Pasti ada jalannya.</font>

1358
01:17:47,958 --> 01:17:49,625
<font size="20">Omong-omong, kita sampai.</font>

1359
01:18:06,625 --> 01:18:09,791
<font size="20">Kau menemukan tulang di makam?</font>

1360
01:18:09,875 --> 01:18:12,166
<font size="20">Apa anehnya itu?</font>

1361
01:18:12,250 --> 01:18:13,416
<font size="20">Karena, Elizabeth,</font>

1362
01:18:15,000 --> 01:18:17,791
<font size="20">tulang-tulangnya ada di atas peti mati.</font>

1363
01:18:27,083 --> 01:18:29,791
<font size="20">Kenapa ada yang menggali kuburan</font>

1364
01:18:31,416 --> 01:18:33,625
<font size="20">untuk menaruh tulang di atas tulang?</font>

1365
01:18:34,250 --> 01:18:35,583
<font size="20">Untuk menyembunyikan mayat.</font>

1366
01:18:39,291 --> 01:18:41,875
<font size="20">Sepertinya ada satu kasus pembunuhan lagi.</font>

1367
01:18:47,208 --> 01:18:48,208
<font size="20">Angkat.</font>

1368
01:18:56,541 --> 01:18:59,791
<font size="20">- Elizabeth bilang begitu?
- Ya.</font>

1369
01:19:02,500 --> 01:19:03,791
<font size="20">Baiklah, ikut aku.</font>

1370
01:19:07,458 --> 01:19:08,291
<font size="20">Tok, tok.</font>

1371
01:19:09,291 --> 01:19:11,708
<font size="20">- Boleh kami masuk?
- Kalian sudah masuk.</font>

1372
01:19:11,791 --> 01:19:13,250
<font size="20">Mau kue lagi, Inspektur?</font>

1373
01:19:13,333 --> 01:19:16,250
<font size="20">Elizabeth, berhentilah bermain-main.
Ini serius.</font>

1374
01:19:17,166 --> 01:19:20,791
<font size="20">Bagaimana kau bisa menemukan jasad itu?</font>

1375
01:19:20,875 --> 01:19:25,291
<font size="20">- Sudah kujelaskan ke Donna.
- Aku ingin mendengarnya langsung.</font>

1376
01:19:25,375 --> 01:19:26,458
<font size="20">Baiklah.</font>

1377
01:19:26,541 --> 01:19:30,750
<font size="20">Saat itu, aku berjalan-jalan,
mencari umbi narsis.</font>

1378
01:19:30,833 --> 01:19:32,083
<font size="20">Narsis?</font>

1379
01:19:32,875 --> 01:19:36,000
<font size="20">- Umbi dafodil untuk pot di jendela.
- Pot di jendela?</font>

1380
01:19:36,083 --> 01:19:38,458
<font size="20">Ya, agar berwarna saat musim semi nanti.</font>

1381
01:19:38,541 --> 01:19:39,708
<font size="20">- Oke. Ya.
- Ya.</font>

1382
01:19:39,791 --> 01:19:42,875
<font size="20">- Lalu aku menggali…
- Dengan tangan?</font>

1383
01:19:42,958 --> 01:19:45,583
<font size="20">Tidak, lah. Jangan asal. Aku bawa sekop.</font>

1384
01:19:45,666 --> 01:19:49,083
<font size="20">- Bodohnya aku. Pakai sekop.
- Ya, untuk mencari umbinya.</font>

1385
01:19:49,166 --> 01:19:51,625
<font size="20">- Baiklah.
- Lalu aku menemukan tulangnya.</font>

1386
01:19:51,708 --> 01:19:55,625
<font size="20">Aku tak habis pikir.
Sungguh kebetulan bisa terjadi.</font>

1387
01:19:59,875 --> 01:20:04,291
<font size="20">Mulai muak aku denganmu
dan geng pensiunan ceriamu.</font>

1388
01:20:04,375 --> 01:20:07,125
<font size="20">Kalian malah menahan putraku.</font>

1389
01:20:07,625 --> 01:20:10,250
<font size="20">Padahal kalian cuma punya
bukti tak langsung.</font>

1390
01:20:10,333 --> 01:20:14,041
<font size="20">Maaf saja, itu belum cukup
untuk menjerat seseorang.</font>

1391
01:20:14,125 --> 01:20:16,166
<font size="20">Jadi, jangan petentengan</font>

1392
01:20:16,250 --> 01:20:18,208
<font size="20">dan temukan pelaku sebenarnya.</font>

1393
01:20:18,291 --> 01:20:20,250
<font size="20">Dengan senang hati, Ron.</font>

1394
01:20:20,333 --> 01:20:22,416
<font size="20">- Bagus.
- Dengan senang hati.</font>

1395
01:20:22,500 --> 01:20:25,166
<font size="20">Tapi jika kau dan "Tuesday Death Society"</font>

1396
01:20:25,250 --> 01:20:27,208
<font size="20">bisa berhenti merecoki sejenak saja,</font>

1397
01:20:27,291 --> 01:20:29,208
<font size="20">pasti penyelidikan bisa berkembang.</font>

1398
01:20:29,291 --> 01:20:34,708
<font size="20">Lebih baik kalian fokus ikut
komunitas kegiatan sosial, main golf,</font>

1399
01:20:34,791 --> 01:20:37,833
<font size="20">beri makan llama aneh,
dan minum obat kolesterol.</font>

1400
01:20:37,916 --> 01:20:40,250
<font size="20">Sisanya biar ditangani kami, ahlinya.</font>

1401
01:20:40,333 --> 01:20:42,125
<font size="20">Kalau telinga susah dengar,</font>

1402
01:20:42,208 --> 01:20:44,625
<font size="20">tolong perbesar volume alat bantunya.</font>

1403
01:20:44,708 --> 01:20:49,250
<font size="20">Penyelidikan polisi
hanya boleh ditangani oleh polisi.</font>

1404
01:20:50,250 --> 01:20:52,875
<font size="20">- Jelas?
- Jelas.</font>

1405
01:20:52,958 --> 01:20:53,791
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1406
01:20:55,583 --> 01:20:57,000
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

1407
01:20:57,583 --> 01:20:58,416
<font size="20">De Freitas.</font>

1408
01:21:00,583 --> 01:21:02,875
<font size="20">Coba visum tulang-tulang itu.</font>

1409
01:21:02,958 --> 01:21:05,041
<font size="20">- Bisa jadi petunjuk besar.
- Ya.</font>

1410
01:22:01,166 --> 01:22:03,750
<font size="20">PERINGATAN TERAKHIR…
JANGAN IKUT CAMPUR!</font>

1411
01:22:15,875 --> 01:22:16,708
<font size="20">Hei.</font>

1412
01:22:17,916 --> 01:22:19,083
<font size="20">Halo.</font>

1413
01:22:19,166 --> 01:22:22,291
<font size="20">Sebenarnya, aku dilarang bicara…</font>

1414
01:22:23,208 --> 01:22:26,916
<font size="20">Tapi tulang yang ditemukan
di pemakaman itu</font>

1415
01:22:27,000 --> 01:22:29,291
<font size="20">diidentifikasi sebagai Peter Mercer.</font>

1416
01:22:31,208 --> 01:22:32,041
<font size="20">Apa?</font>

1417
01:22:34,166 --> 01:22:36,125
<font size="20">Astaga, sungguh tak terduga.</font>

1418
01:22:38,666 --> 01:22:40,000
<font size="20">Konstabel De Freitas,</font>

1419
01:22:40,083 --> 01:22:43,333
<font size="20">ini Inspektur Penny Gray
dan suaminya, John.</font>

1420
01:22:43,416 --> 01:22:45,000
<font size="20">- Senang berkenalan.
- Hai.</font>

1421
01:22:45,083 --> 01:22:49,375
<font size="20">- Waktu masih aktif, Penny luar biasa.
- Selalu mencuri perhatian.</font>

1422
01:22:49,458 --> 01:22:50,583
<font size="20">Senang bertemu, Bu.</font>

1423
01:22:51,666 --> 01:22:55,583
<font size="20">Penny, Donna ini
polisi muda yang cemerlang.</font>

1424
01:22:57,583 --> 01:23:01,583
<font size="20">Dia berbaik hati berbagi informasi
tentang tulang temuan Bogdan.</font>

1425
01:23:01,666 --> 01:23:06,083
<font size="20">Itu tulang Peter Mercer,
ada pelat logam di lututnya,</font>

1426
01:23:06,166 --> 01:23:08,583
<font size="20">dan sudah dikubur lebih dari 50 tahun.</font>

1427
01:23:08,666 --> 01:23:12,750
<font size="20">Jadi, tak ada kaitannya
dengan pembunuhan Ventham?</font>

1428
01:23:12,833 --> 01:23:15,958
<font size="20">Tidak, tapi Ron dan Ibrahim
menanyai sejumlah warga,</font>

1429
01:23:16,041 --> 01:23:21,208
<font size="20">lalu bisa mencoret Bernard, Marjorie,
dan Pastur Mackie dari daftar tersangka.</font>

1430
01:23:22,125 --> 01:23:23,750
<font size="20">Begitu, ya?</font>

1431
01:23:25,125 --> 01:23:29,375
<font size="20">Tahun 1970-an, aku dan Penny
sering datang ke misa di sini.</font>

1432
01:23:29,458 --> 01:23:30,333
<font size="20">Benarkah?</font>

1433
01:23:30,416 --> 01:23:34,333
<font size="20">Tapi waktu itu Mackie berbeda.
Bisa dibilang lebih kalem.</font>

1434
01:23:34,416 --> 01:23:35,625
<font size="20">Pokoknya, selamat, Donna.</font>

1435
01:23:36,666 --> 01:23:37,916
<font size="20">Kau dengar, Penny?</font>

1436
01:23:38,416 --> 01:23:41,000
<font size="20">Gadis ini meneruskan jejakmu.</font>

1437
01:23:48,041 --> 01:23:52,333
<font size="20">Jadi, kau tidak ingat
kapan foto ini diambil?</font>

1438
01:23:52,416 --> 01:23:55,166
<font size="20">Sudah kubilang, aku sering dipotret orang.</font>

1439
01:23:55,250 --> 01:23:57,750
<font size="20">Olehmu juga. Aku tak paham masalahnya.</font>

1440
01:23:57,833 --> 01:24:00,041
<font size="20">- Aku jelaskan…
- Pak, sudah aku coba cegah.</font>

1441
01:24:00,125 --> 01:24:02,083
<font size="20">- Tidak… Ron?
- Terima kasih.</font>

1442
01:24:02,166 --> 01:24:04,458
<font size="20">- Ayah?
- Kenapa kau di sini?</font>

1443
01:24:04,541 --> 01:24:08,291
<font size="20">Kenapa norak sekali bajumu?
Baju nikahmu, ya?</font>

1444
01:24:08,375 --> 01:24:09,750
<font size="20">Memang.</font>

1445
01:24:10,250 --> 01:24:11,416
<font size="20">Dua kali, malah.</font>

1446
01:24:11,500 --> 01:24:16,625
<font size="20">Jason berhak didampingi kuasa hukum.
Aku di sini mewakili.</font>

1447
01:24:16,708 --> 01:24:18,208
<font size="20">Kau bukan pengacara, Ron.</font>

1448
01:24:18,291 --> 01:24:22,000
<font size="20">Memang tak berlisensi,
tapi jam terbangku tinggi.</font>

1449
01:24:22,083 --> 01:24:25,166
<font size="20">Sudah sering adu urat
saat ditangkap aparat.</font>

1450
01:24:25,250 --> 01:24:26,291
<font size="20">Astaga.</font>

1451
01:24:26,375 --> 01:24:28,291
<font size="20">Dia tidak bersalah, Hudson,</font>

1452
01:24:28,375 --> 01:24:31,666
<font size="20">dan hanya ada bukti tidak langsung.</font>

1453
01:24:31,750 --> 01:24:33,875
<font size="20">Dia tak punya alibi, Ron.</font>

1454
01:24:33,958 --> 01:24:36,000
<font size="20">Biar kuperkenalkan diri.</font>

1455
01:24:36,083 --> 01:24:37,041
<font size="20">Ibrahim!</font>

1456
01:24:37,125 --> 01:24:39,125
<font size="20">Pengacara baru Jason memintaku</font>

1457
01:24:39,208 --> 01:24:41,750
<font size="20">mendampingi evaluasi kejiwaan putranya.</font>

1458
01:24:41,833 --> 01:24:44,666
<font size="20">Coba perhatikan. Dia tampak stres berat.</font>

1459
01:24:45,250 --> 01:24:48,916
<font size="20">Jelas gejala PTSD.
Jika dilanjutkan tanpa dampinganku,</font>

1460
01:24:49,583 --> 01:24:51,666
<font size="20">siap-siap digugat atas kelalaian.</font>

1461
01:24:51,750 --> 01:24:54,125
<font size="20">- Inspektur, kau suka kue, 'kan?
- Tidak!</font>

1462
01:24:54,208 --> 01:24:56,000
<font size="20">Ini lemon drizzle buatanku.</font>

1463
01:24:56,083 --> 01:24:59,125
<font size="20">Kalian semua sibuk. Butuh energi.</font>

1464
01:24:59,208 --> 01:25:00,333
<font size="20">Mau kupotongkan?</font>

1465
01:25:00,416 --> 01:25:02,833
<font size="20">Semua keluar, atau kalian ditangkap!</font>

1466
01:25:02,916 --> 01:25:06,291
<font size="20">Hei, hei. Seingatku ini Britania Raya.</font>

1467
01:25:06,375 --> 01:25:09,708
<font size="20">Di Britania Raya,
semua orang berhak atas pengacara.</font>

1468
01:25:09,791 --> 01:25:12,041
<font size="20">Jason menelepon Ian Ventham tiga kali</font>

1469
01:25:12,125 --> 01:25:13,791
<font size="20">sebelum Tony Curran dibunuh.</font>

1470
01:25:13,875 --> 01:25:15,916
<font size="20">Namanya juga anak muda!
Lengket dengan HP-nya.</font>

1471
01:25:16,000 --> 01:25:18,041
<font size="20">Di mana Jason saat Curran dibunuh?</font>

1472
01:25:18,125 --> 01:25:22,041
<font size="20">Dia tak mau menjawab.
Bagiku, itu tanda dia bersalah, Ron.</font>

1473
01:25:23,166 --> 01:25:24,083
<font size="20">Jadi?</font>

1474
01:25:24,166 --> 01:25:25,166
<font size="20">Apanya?</font>

1475
01:25:25,250 --> 01:25:27,875
<font size="20">- Kau di mana waktu itu?
- Itu urusanku.</font>

1476
01:25:27,958 --> 01:25:30,541
<font size="20">- Katanya mau jadi pengacaraku?
- Sekarang jadi ayahmu.</font>

1477
01:25:30,625 --> 01:25:33,500
<font size="20">Jadi, jangan berbelit-belit lagi
dan jawab saja.</font>

1478
01:25:33,583 --> 01:25:36,250
<font size="20">Di mana kau saat Curran dibunuh?</font>

1479
01:25:36,333 --> 01:25:38,791
<font size="20">Biar kita sempat pulang menonton bola.</font>

1480
01:25:38,875 --> 01:25:40,166
<font size="20">Langsung jawab. Ayo.</font>

1481
01:25:43,125 --> 01:25:45,083
<font size="20">Aku bersama istrinya Ian Ventham.</font>

1482
01:25:46,541 --> 01:25:47,541
<font size="20">Gemma Ventham?</font>

1483
01:25:48,958 --> 01:25:50,916
<font size="20">- Kami…
- Selingkuh?</font>

1484
01:25:51,416 --> 01:25:52,916
<font size="20">Wah, Jason.</font>

1485
01:25:55,000 --> 01:25:56,208
<font size="20">Dia bisa bersaksi?</font>

1486
01:25:57,416 --> 01:26:00,250
<font size="20">Ya, maafkan aku, Ayah.</font>

1487
01:26:00,333 --> 01:26:03,083
<font size="20">Tak apa. Dulu Ayah juga selingkuhan ibumu.</font>

1488
01:26:03,166 --> 01:26:06,125
<font size="20">Nah, itu dia, Pak Polisi. Alibinya jelas.</font>

1489
01:26:06,833 --> 01:26:07,916
<font size="20">Bisa dibuktikan?</font>

1490
01:26:10,125 --> 01:26:13,291
<font size="20">Ya, bisa. Bisa kembalikan ponselku?</font>

1491
01:26:23,750 --> 01:26:28,125
<font size="20">Ada cap waktu dan tanggal.
Pastikan saja ke Gemma kalau ragu.</font>

1492
01:26:29,458 --> 01:26:31,833
<font size="20">Inspektur Hudson. Bukti sudah jelas.</font>

1493
01:26:31,916 --> 01:26:34,208
<font size="20">Tak ada dasarnya menahan anakku.</font>

1494
01:26:34,291 --> 01:26:37,000
<font size="20">Waktunya mencari pembunuh sebenarnya.</font>

1495
01:26:39,916 --> 01:26:40,750
<font size="20">Keluar.</font>

1496
01:26:41,958 --> 01:26:43,750
<font size="20">Semua keluar dari ruangan ini!</font>

1497
01:26:43,833 --> 01:26:45,625
<font size="20">- Kuenya di sini, ya.
- Keluar!</font>

1498
01:26:46,500 --> 01:26:49,166
<font size="20">- Ayah pahlawan.
- Senang bisa bantu. Ibs…</font>

1499
01:26:49,250 --> 01:26:51,291
<font size="20">- Kau juga, De Freitas.
- Ya.</font>

1500
01:26:55,541 --> 01:26:58,208
<font size="20">ELIZABETH: TERTARIK
MENDATANGI BOBBY TANNER?</font>

1501
01:27:07,083 --> 01:27:10,208
<font size="20">- Aku baru tahu kau punya mobil.
- Hadiah pensiun.</font>

1502
01:27:11,500 --> 01:27:12,541
<font size="20">Dari MI6.</font>

1503
01:27:20,250 --> 01:27:22,583
<font size="20">Kau yakin Bobby Tanner di sini?</font>

1504
01:27:22,666 --> 01:27:24,625
<font size="20">Bertahun-tahun polisi mencarinya.</font>

1505
01:27:24,708 --> 01:27:28,916
<font size="20">Ya, cukup yakin. Aku sering
mengandalkan intuisi meski riskan.</font>

1506
01:27:29,000 --> 01:27:32,083
<font size="20">Seiring waktu kau akan sadar,
intuisi kadang benar.</font>

1507
01:27:32,166 --> 01:27:36,375
<font size="20">- Tahu dari mana dia di sini?
- Tempo hari, aku dikirimi bunga.</font>

1508
01:27:36,458 --> 01:27:40,625
<font size="20">Isinya bunga lili, yakut,
anyelir, tulip, dan yolanda.</font>

1509
01:27:40,708 --> 01:27:42,375
<font size="20">- Pasti cantik, ya.
- Ya.</font>

1510
01:27:42,875 --> 01:27:46,875
<font size="20">Sangat cantik, sampai kau baca
kartu ucapannya, "Jangan ikut campur."</font>

1511
01:27:46,958 --> 01:27:50,958
<font size="20">Kombinasi bunga itu juga punya arti
yang sangat negatif.</font>

1512
01:27:51,041 --> 01:27:52,750
<font size="20">Jelas ancaman terselubung.</font>

1513
01:27:53,291 --> 01:27:54,375
<font size="20">Sebentar.</font>

1514
01:27:54,458 --> 01:27:57,791
<font size="20">Kau curiga pengirimnya
terkait investor di Coopers Chase?</font>

1515
01:27:58,791 --> 01:28:00,625
<font size="20">Betul sekali, Donna.</font>

1516
01:28:01,708 --> 01:28:04,083
<font size="20">Bunganya segar dan diantar langsung.</font>

1517
01:28:04,166 --> 01:28:06,708
<font size="20">Artinya, tokonya ada
di dekat Coopers Chase.</font>

1518
01:28:06,791 --> 01:28:09,291
<font size="20">- Lalu aku teringat kartu itu.
- Kartu?</font>

1519
01:28:09,375 --> 01:28:13,708
<font size="20">Di bunga Maud saat pemakaman
Tony Curran. Inisial pengirimnya BT.</font>

1520
01:28:13,791 --> 01:28:17,750
<font size="20">Desainnya sama persis dengan kartu ini.</font>

1521
01:28:18,958 --> 01:28:22,000
<font size="20">Desainnya sangat khas,
jadi kucari di internet.</font>

1522
01:28:22,500 --> 01:28:27,125
<font size="20">Toko bunga Thorny Blooms di Moreton,
milik Derek Ward.</font>

1523
01:28:28,166 --> 01:28:30,208
<font size="20">Menurutmu Bobby Tanner di dalam?</font>

1524
01:28:30,708 --> 01:28:31,541
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1525
01:28:32,041 --> 01:28:32,958
<font size="20">Dan Derek Ward?</font>

1526
01:28:33,458 --> 01:28:37,708
<font size="20">Aku yakin tak ada orang
yang pernah melihat keduanya</font>

1527
01:28:37,791 --> 01:28:39,375
<font size="20">di ruangan yang sama.</font>

1528
01:28:41,375 --> 01:28:43,833
<font size="20">Bobby Tanner dikenal
suka memotong jari musuhnya.</font>

1529
01:28:44,750 --> 01:28:48,583
<font size="20">Aduh, polosnya.
Itu belum seberapa sadisnya.</font>

1530
01:28:53,375 --> 01:28:55,583
<font size="20">Halo, bisa saya bantu?</font>

1531
01:28:56,083 --> 01:28:59,333
<font size="20">Halo. Tadi aku menelepon
soal pesanan untuk pernikahan.</font>

1532
01:28:59,416 --> 01:29:01,291
<font size="20">Derek Ward ada?</font>

1533
01:29:01,791 --> 01:29:02,916
<font size="20">Di bawah.</font>

1534
01:29:18,625 --> 01:29:20,208
<font size="20">Gajah ke E6.</font>

1535
01:29:23,083 --> 01:29:25,166
<font size="20">Apa strategimu, Bogdan?</font>

1536
01:29:25,666 --> 01:29:30,000
<font size="20">Kau pasti penasaran,
tapi harus tebak sendiri.</font>

1537
01:29:30,083 --> 01:29:31,208
<font size="20">Benar juga.</font>

1538
01:29:32,833 --> 01:29:36,291
<font size="20">Sebenarnya, ada hal lain
yang ingin kutanyakan.</font>

1539
01:29:36,375 --> 01:29:38,833
<font size="20">- Boleh?
- Tentu saja.</font>

1540
01:29:39,416 --> 01:29:43,541
<font size="20">Korban pertama, si kontraktor itu.</font>

1541
01:29:43,625 --> 01:29:45,041
<font size="20">Dia…</font>

1542
01:29:45,750 --> 01:29:47,750
<font size="20">Astaga.</font>

1543
01:29:48,833 --> 01:29:50,250
<font size="20">Aku lupa namanya.</font>

1544
01:29:50,875 --> 01:29:53,541
<font size="20">- Tony Curran.
- Ya, itu dia. Benar.</font>

1545
01:29:53,625 --> 01:29:56,291
<font size="20">Setelah mendengar semua informasinya,</font>

1546
01:29:57,250 --> 01:29:59,291
<font size="20">kurasa aku tahu siapa pembunuhnya.</font>

1547
01:30:13,541 --> 01:30:16,875
<font size="20">- Bisa saya bantu?
- Perkenalkan, Derek.</font>

1548
01:30:16,958 --> 01:30:18,833
<font size="20">Oh, maaf, kupanggil Derek,</font>

1549
01:30:18,916 --> 01:30:21,250
<font size="20">atau Bobby saja?</font>

1550
01:30:22,583 --> 01:30:25,958
<font size="20">Elizabeth Best.
Sudah kuduga kau akan muncul.</font>

1551
01:30:30,166 --> 01:30:32,625
<font size="20">Apa kau dalang pembunuhan
Ian Ventham dan Tony Curran?</font>

1552
01:30:33,833 --> 01:30:35,458
<font size="20">Tanpa basa-basi, ya?</font>

1553
01:30:36,250 --> 01:30:37,083
<font size="20">Jadi, benar?</font>

1554
01:30:37,750 --> 01:30:39,916
<font size="20">Demi saham mereka di Coopers Chase?</font>

1555
01:30:41,416 --> 01:30:42,250
<font size="20">Tidak.</font>

1556
01:30:42,333 --> 01:30:45,250
<font size="20">Bukan aku dalangnya. Meski niat itu ada.</font>

1557
01:30:45,333 --> 01:30:48,250
<font size="20">Di mana kau saat Tony Curran dibunuh?</font>

1558
01:30:48,333 --> 01:30:52,958
<font size="20">Di Hotel Dorchester,
menyiapkan rangkaian bunga</font>

1559
01:30:53,041 --> 01:30:56,416
<font size="20">untuk pesta ulang tahun
Pangeran Khalid Al-Berro ke-21.</font>

1560
01:30:56,500 --> 01:30:59,791
<font size="20">Ada 200 saksi mata yang bisa membuktikan.</font>

1561
01:30:59,875 --> 01:31:01,250
<font size="20">Jadi, ini bukan kedok?</font>

1562
01:31:03,208 --> 01:31:04,541
<font size="20">Kau penjual bunga?</font>

1563
01:31:05,125 --> 01:31:07,500
<font size="20">Merangkai bunga segar,</font>

1564
01:31:08,041 --> 01:31:09,041
<font size="20">menyuntingnya,</font>

1565
01:31:09,625 --> 01:31:11,416
<font size="20">itu satu-satunya hal yang kucintai</font>

1566
01:31:11,916 --> 01:31:13,916
<font size="20">dan kujalani tanpa kepura-puraan.</font>

1567
01:31:15,208 --> 01:31:19,291
<font size="20">Kami dengar sekarang kau
pemilik tunggal Coopers Chase.</font>

1568
01:31:19,375 --> 01:31:21,000
<font size="20">Sayangnya, ya.</font>

1569
01:31:21,750 --> 01:31:24,500
<font size="20">Sudah bukan investasi yang menarik bagiku.</font>

1570
01:31:25,750 --> 01:31:27,958
<font size="20">Lantas, apa rencanamu?</font>

1571
01:31:29,000 --> 01:31:32,833
<font size="20">Jual secepat mungkin, semahal mungkin.</font>

1572
01:31:37,041 --> 01:31:40,541
<font size="20">Aku selalu memperhatikan
setiap Elizabeth bicara, Bogdan.</font>

1573
01:31:41,750 --> 01:31:43,500
<font size="20">Dan tampaknya…</font>

1574
01:31:44,041 --> 01:31:47,125
<font size="20">Kau juga sedang ada kesulitan, ya?</font>

1575
01:31:47,875 --> 01:31:48,875
<font size="20">Soal ibumu?</font>

1576
01:31:54,083 --> 01:31:54,958
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1577
01:31:56,875 --> 01:31:58,500
<font size="20">Kuda ke E4.</font>

1578
01:32:01,125 --> 01:32:04,041
<font size="20">Maaf jika menyinggung, Bogdan,</font>

1579
01:32:06,166 --> 01:32:08,041
<font size="20">apa kau membunuh Tony Curran?</font>

1580
01:32:11,625 --> 01:32:14,291
<font size="20">Kau curiga aku membunuh Tony Curran?</font>

1581
01:32:15,250 --> 01:32:16,458
<font size="20">Benar.</font>

1582
01:32:17,166 --> 01:32:18,333
<font size="20">Sayangnya begitu.</font>

1583
01:32:23,125 --> 01:32:25,208
<font size="20">Kuda ke E2.</font>

1584
01:32:28,458 --> 01:32:31,791
<font size="20">Donna, bisa tolong keluar sebentar?</font>

1585
01:32:32,750 --> 01:32:35,541
<font size="20">- Kau mau apa?
- Tenang. Aku bisa jaga diri.</font>

1586
01:32:43,083 --> 01:32:43,916
<font size="20">Jadi,</font>

1587
01:32:45,166 --> 01:32:46,750
<font size="20">privasi penting bagimu?</font>

1588
01:32:47,416 --> 01:32:49,958
<font size="20">Kau mengancamku? Jangan nekat.</font>

1589
01:32:50,041 --> 01:32:53,541
<font size="20">Kami dapat tiga pekerja Polandia
di Amsterdam pagi ini, Bos.</font>

1590
01:32:53,625 --> 01:32:54,916
<font size="20">Ini paspor mereka…</font>

1591
01:33:02,125 --> 01:33:04,125
<font size="20">Kau merekrut pekerja di Amsterdam?</font>

1592
01:33:04,208 --> 01:33:06,875
<font size="20">Kenapa paspornya diserahkan padamu, Bobby?</font>

1593
01:33:07,625 --> 01:33:08,625
<font size="20">Sebagai jaminan.</font>

1594
01:33:08,708 --> 01:33:10,625
<font size="20">Tak perlu heran.</font>

1595
01:33:11,250 --> 01:33:12,333
<font size="20">Kami ini pebisnis.</font>

1596
01:33:13,500 --> 01:33:16,291
<font size="20">Merekrut pekerja secara ilegal
dari luar negeri,</font>

1597
01:33:16,375 --> 01:33:18,541
<font size="20">lalu menahan paspor mereka,</font>

1598
01:33:18,625 --> 01:33:22,041
<font size="20">itu jelas melanggar hukum, Bobby.</font>

1599
01:33:22,666 --> 01:33:25,666
<font size="20">Ancaman hukumannya 25 tahun penjara.</font>

1600
01:33:25,750 --> 01:33:27,166
<font size="20">Itu minimum.</font>

1601
01:33:28,333 --> 01:33:30,791
<font size="20">Bagaimana kalau begini?</font>

1602
01:33:31,500 --> 01:33:34,000
<font size="20">Hentikan seluruh operasi ini.</font>

1603
01:33:34,625 --> 01:33:36,333
<font size="20">Kembalikan paspor pekerja.</font>

1604
01:33:37,416 --> 01:33:43,083
<font size="20">Lalu jual Coopers Chase
ke pembeli pilihanku, sesuai harga pasar.</font>

1605
01:33:43,166 --> 01:33:47,666
<font size="20">Sebagai gantinya,
penyamaran dan lokasimu tetap aman.</font>

1606
01:33:48,750 --> 01:33:51,541
<font size="20">Jangan sampai ada
polisi berseliweran di sini.</font>

1607
01:33:51,625 --> 01:33:55,041
<font size="20">Polwan tadi juga harus kau urus.</font>

1608
01:33:55,541 --> 01:33:57,625
<font size="20">Kalau tidak, aku yang turun tangan.</font>

1609
01:33:59,541 --> 01:34:01,625
<font size="20">Berani mencelakai Donna,</font>

1610
01:34:01,708 --> 01:34:06,166
<font size="20">aku yang akan menaburkan
mawar merah di atas petimu.</font>

1611
01:34:08,458 --> 01:34:10,958
<font size="20">Aku tak tahu alasanmu membunuh Tony.</font>

1612
01:34:12,291 --> 01:34:14,083
<font size="20">Mungkin ada alasan masuk akal.</font>

1613
01:34:15,083 --> 01:34:17,083
<font size="20">Tapi aku tahu kaulah pelakunya.</font>

1614
01:34:19,583 --> 01:34:21,416
<font size="20">Kau cerdas, Stephen.</font>

1615
01:34:22,416 --> 01:34:24,666
<font size="20">Kau pasti tak meninggalkan jejak.</font>

1616
01:34:31,083 --> 01:34:33,041
<font size="20">Tolong pahami, Stephen,</font>

1617
01:34:34,000 --> 01:34:35,333
<font size="20">itu tidak sengaja.</font>

1618
01:34:37,208 --> 01:34:39,833
<font size="20">Aku tak berniat membunuh Tony.</font>

1619
01:34:39,916 --> 01:34:43,000
<font size="20">Aku hanya ingin pasporku.
Tolong pahami itu.</font>

1620
01:34:44,000 --> 01:34:45,750
<font size="20">Percayalah, Stephen.</font>

1621
01:34:47,250 --> 01:34:48,166
<font size="20">Stephen.</font>

1622
01:34:54,333 --> 01:34:55,958
<font size="20">Astaga, maaf.</font>

1623
01:34:56,041 --> 01:34:57,416
<font size="20">Maaf, Nak…</font>

1624
01:34:58,125 --> 01:34:59,208
<font size="20">Astaga.</font>

1625
01:34:59,833 --> 01:35:01,625
<font size="20">Tadi kita bahas apa?</font>

1626
01:35:05,833 --> 01:35:09,083
<font size="20">Kau cerita tentang sejarah.</font>

1627
01:35:09,958 --> 01:35:10,791
<font size="20">Baiklah.</font>

1628
01:35:13,000 --> 01:35:16,208
<font size="20">- Mau teh lagi?
- Ya. Boleh.</font>

1629
01:35:17,208 --> 01:35:18,041
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

1630
01:35:18,750 --> 01:35:20,458
<font size="20">Gulanya satu. Oh, jangan.</font>

1631
01:35:21,000 --> 01:35:23,791
<font size="20">Elizabeth tidak ada, 'kan? Empat saja.</font>

1632
01:35:24,416 --> 01:35:27,333
<font size="20">Jadi, kita sepakat?</font>

1633
01:35:32,833 --> 01:35:33,666
<font size="20">Sepakat.</font>

1634
01:35:40,500 --> 01:35:42,250
<font size="20">Tadi kau bilang "kami"?</font>

1635
01:35:42,750 --> 01:35:44,458
<font size="20">Pebisnis? Siapa itu "kami"?</font>

1636
01:35:45,250 --> 01:35:48,166
<font size="20">Rekan bisnisku, mendiang Tony Curran.</font>

1637
01:35:48,750 --> 01:35:52,208
<font size="20">Tony Curran terlibat
penahanan paspor pekerja?</font>

1638
01:35:52,791 --> 01:35:54,416
<font size="20">Pekerjanya kami bagi rata.</font>

1639
01:35:54,500 --> 01:35:57,791
<font size="20">Sebagian bekerja untukku.
Sopir truk, kurir bunga.</font>

1640
01:35:57,875 --> 01:35:59,958
<font size="20">Lainnya ikut Tony ke Coopers Chase.</font>

1641
01:36:00,041 --> 01:36:02,416
<font size="20">Mereka manusia, bukan komoditas.</font>

1642
01:36:02,500 --> 01:36:05,583
<font size="20">Aku masih mengembalikan
paspor mereka sesekali.</font>

1643
01:36:05,666 --> 01:36:07,083
<font size="20">Bisa mudik bertemu keluarga.</font>

1644
01:36:07,708 --> 01:36:10,458
<font size="20">Beda dengan Tony. Dia haus kuasa.</font>

1645
01:36:10,541 --> 01:36:13,416
<font size="20">Jarang mengembalikan paspor pekerjanya.</font>

1646
01:36:16,375 --> 01:36:17,208
<font size="20">Astaga.</font>

1647
01:36:35,041 --> 01:36:37,958
<font size="20">Hubungi semuanya.
Ron, Ibrahim, Joyce, Hudson.</font>

1648
01:36:38,041 --> 01:36:39,958
<font size="20">- Suruh mereka segera datang.
- Ke mana?</font>

1649
01:36:40,041 --> 01:36:43,208
<font size="20">Coopers Chase, flatku.
Tujuh menit lagi kita sampai.</font>

1650
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:47,125
<font size="20">- Mumpung hangat.
- Terima kasih.</font>

1651
01:36:47,625 --> 01:36:48,458
<font size="20">Harumnya.</font>

1652
01:37:16,083 --> 01:37:18,875
<font size="20">Stephen, jangan diminum. Mungkin beracun.</font>

1653
01:37:18,958 --> 01:37:21,958
<font size="20">- Apa? Apa maksudmu?
- Sudah terminum.</font>

1654
01:37:22,958 --> 01:37:25,000
<font size="20">Ya Tuhan. Astaga, Donna.</font>

1655
01:37:27,458 --> 01:37:29,416
<font size="20">- Mau lari?
- Tak semudah itu.</font>

1656
01:37:29,500 --> 01:37:30,708
<font size="20">Siap-siap, Nak.</font>

1657
01:37:32,500 --> 01:37:33,708
<font size="20">Masih kuat juga aku.</font>

1658
01:37:36,166 --> 01:37:39,125
<font size="20">Joyce, Bogdan mungkin
sudah meracuni Stephen.</font>

1659
01:37:41,875 --> 01:37:43,083
<font size="20">Tak ada yang aneh.</font>

1660
01:37:44,166 --> 01:37:45,333
<font size="20">Nadinya normal.</font>

1661
01:37:45,958 --> 01:37:49,291
<font size="20">Tapi tetap harus diperiksa.
Kupanggilkan dokter jaga.</font>

1662
01:37:49,375 --> 01:37:50,208
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1663
01:37:52,500 --> 01:37:55,125
<font size="20">Bogdan Jankowski, kau ditangkap</font>

1664
01:37:55,208 --> 01:37:57,291
<font size="20">atas dugaan pembunuhan Tony Curran.</font>

1665
01:37:57,375 --> 01:37:59,916
<font size="20">Mana buktinya? Aku tak mengakui apa pun.</font>

1666
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:03,416
<font size="20">Stephen memang kadang melantur.
Dia mana ingat.</font>

1667
01:38:03,500 --> 01:38:04,333
<font size="20">Tunggu.</font>

1668
01:38:05,041 --> 01:38:08,166
<font size="20">Kalau kau mengakuinya ke Stephen,
dia tak perlu ingat.</font>

1669
01:38:08,250 --> 01:38:12,708
<font size="20">Kau bicara apa?
Biarkan kami selesai bermain.</font>

1670
01:38:13,708 --> 01:38:16,333
<font size="20">Stephen merekam semua permainan caturnya.</font>

1671
01:38:17,916 --> 01:38:19,333
<font size="20">Kuda ke E4.</font>

1672
01:38:19,416 --> 01:38:22,500
<font size="20">Dia mendengarkannya
untuk mempelajari strategi lawan.</font>

1673
01:38:24,291 --> 01:38:26,625
<font size="20">Aku tak berniat membunuh Tony.</font>

1674
01:38:26,708 --> 01:38:29,708
<font size="20">Aku hanya ingin pasporku.
Tolong pahami itu.</font>

1675
01:38:30,208 --> 01:38:31,916
<font size="20">Percayalah, Stephen.</font>

1676
01:38:34,500 --> 01:38:35,583
<font size="20">Bogdan.</font>

1677
01:38:37,541 --> 01:38:38,708
<font size="20">Apa motifmu?</font>

1678
01:38:40,791 --> 01:38:42,125
<font size="20">Aku tak sengaja.</font>

1679
01:38:43,500 --> 01:38:45,250
<font size="20">Aku hanya ingin pasporku.</font>

1680
01:38:46,583 --> 01:38:50,416
<font size="20">Ditahan Tony, jadi aku ke rumahnya,
tapi dia tak mau kembalikan.</font>

1681
01:38:51,083 --> 01:38:54,500
<font size="20">Dia keras kepala.
Lalu dia marah, menyerangku.</font>

1682
01:38:54,583 --> 01:38:58,583
<font size="20">Wajar aku membela diri.
Dibunuh atau membunuh. Aku terpaksa.</font>

1683
01:38:59,791 --> 01:39:01,958
<font size="20">Jadi, ya, aku membunuh Tony.</font>

1684
01:39:02,041 --> 01:39:07,375
<font size="20">Tapi itu tak terencana.
Aku tak sengaja. Aku menyesal.</font>

1685
01:39:09,375 --> 01:39:12,000
<font size="20">Kau tak meracuni Stephen, bukan?</font>

1686
01:39:12,541 --> 01:39:15,125
<font size="20">Tentu saja tidak.</font>

1687
01:39:15,208 --> 01:39:17,000
<font size="20">Dia kawanku.</font>

1688
01:39:18,041 --> 01:39:19,916
<font size="20">Ya. Aku tahu.</font>

1689
01:39:21,500 --> 01:39:22,916
<font size="20">Giring ke markas.</font>

1690
01:39:31,416 --> 01:39:34,666
<font size="20">JASON 'THE HAMMER' RITCHIE REBUT
TAKHTA JUARA DI LAGA PALING SENGIT</font>

1691
01:39:41,708 --> 01:39:43,625
<font size="20">Sudah berapa lama dia latihan?</font>

1692
01:39:43,708 --> 01:39:46,083
<font size="20">- Entah, 6-12 bulan?
- Bisa setenang itu.</font>

1693
01:39:46,166 --> 01:39:49,166
<font size="20">Ya, dia tak terlihat gugup.</font>

1694
01:39:49,250 --> 01:39:51,083
<font size="20">- Aku suka itu.
- Aku deg-degan.</font>

1695
01:39:52,875 --> 01:39:55,166
<font size="20">- Aku malah tegang.
- Seperti pebalet.</font>

1696
01:39:55,250 --> 01:39:56,250
<font size="20">Ya. Persis.</font>

1697
01:39:57,458 --> 01:39:59,416
<font size="20">- Aku suka bagian itu.
- Lihat!</font>

1698
01:39:59,500 --> 01:40:03,416
<font size="20">- Kok, bisa mendarat tanpa jatuh?
- Tapi tetap senyum dan tenang.</font>

1699
01:40:05,166 --> 01:40:06,666
<font size="20">Astaga, aku jadi tegang.</font>

1700
01:40:09,875 --> 01:40:12,125
<font size="20">- Penutupnya mantap!
- Anakku hebat!</font>

1701
01:40:12,208 --> 01:40:13,500
<font size="20">Selamat.</font>

1702
01:40:13,583 --> 01:40:15,958
<font size="20">- Ronnie, selamat.
- Terima kasih.</font>

1703
01:40:16,500 --> 01:40:17,541
<font size="20">Astaga.</font>

1704
01:40:18,500 --> 01:40:20,375
<font size="20">- Hebat.
- Terima kasih.</font>

1705
01:40:31,125 --> 01:40:33,833
<font size="20">Maaf mengganggu tiba-tiba, John.</font>

1706
01:40:34,458 --> 01:40:35,750
<font size="20">Komplet, ya.</font>

1707
01:40:36,583 --> 01:40:38,291
<font size="20">Ada apa ini?</font>

1708
01:40:39,375 --> 01:40:41,166
<font size="20">Aku menemukan berkas ini.</font>

1709
01:40:41,250 --> 01:40:43,916
<font size="20">Kasus dingin yang kami gali,
wanita berpakaian putih.</font>

1710
01:40:44,625 --> 01:40:46,583
<font size="20">Tersimpan rapi. Tersembunyi.</font>

1711
01:40:46,666 --> 01:40:49,583
<font size="20">Penny tak pernah menawarkan
untuk menyelidiki ini.</font>

1712
01:40:50,166 --> 01:40:51,750
<font size="20">Kira-kira kenapa?</font>

1713
01:40:53,750 --> 01:40:56,458
<font size="20">Kau ingat kasus Angela Hughes, Pen?</font>

1714
01:40:57,875 --> 01:41:00,125
<font size="20">Angela tewas dalam perampokan.</font>

1715
01:41:00,208 --> 01:41:03,583
<font size="20">Ditikam penyusup bertopeng,
lalu jatuh dari jendela kamar.</font>

1716
01:41:03,666 --> 01:41:05,708
<font size="20">Nyatanya, tak ada penyusup.</font>

1717
01:41:06,333 --> 01:41:09,166
<font size="20">Pacar Angela, Peter Mercer,
adalah pembunuhnya.</font>

1718
01:41:09,250 --> 01:41:12,208
<font size="20">Polisi tak mendakwa
karena percaya kebohongannya.</font>

1719
01:41:12,291 --> 01:41:14,708
<font size="20">Polisi suka Mercer.
Mereka dekat dengannya.</font>

1720
01:41:15,583 --> 01:41:18,083
<font size="20">Tapi kau tahu yang sebenarnya, 'kan, Pen?</font>

1721
01:41:18,166 --> 01:41:22,458
<font size="20">Kau tahu Mercer bersalah.
Itu terbaca jelas olehmu.</font>

1722
01:41:26,458 --> 01:41:28,333
<font size="20">Penny membunuh Peter Mercer.</font>

1723
01:41:29,208 --> 01:41:30,208
<font size="20">Benar, John?</font>

1724
01:41:32,291 --> 01:41:36,791
<font size="20">Penny tahu Mercer tak akan diadili,
jadi Penny membunuhnya sendiri.</font>

1725
01:41:37,750 --> 01:41:42,125
<font size="20">Menyembunyikan jasadnya di makam.
Kau pasti membantunya.</font>

1726
01:41:42,208 --> 01:41:46,166
<font size="20">Tulang yang ditemukan Bogdan,
itulah jasadnya.</font>

1727
01:41:48,375 --> 01:41:53,416
<font size="20">Kau bilang kalian sering datang ke misa
bersama Pastur Mackie tahun 1970-an?</font>

1728
01:41:53,500 --> 01:41:58,541
<font size="20">Artinya, kalian berdua ada
di sekitar pemakaman saat Mercer hilang.</font>

1729
01:41:59,666 --> 01:42:05,583
<font size="20">Tapi petunjuk utama justru foto TKP.</font>

1730
01:42:05,666 --> 01:42:08,166
<font size="20">Karena Penny ada di semua foto.</font>

1731
01:42:09,750 --> 01:42:13,500
<font size="20">- Dan itu membuktikan apa?
- Secara resmi, tak ada. Tapi lihat.</font>

1732
01:42:14,041 --> 01:42:16,958
<font size="20">Lihat tatapannya pada Peter Mercer.</font>

1733
01:42:17,041 --> 01:42:18,125
<font size="20">Air mukanya itu.</font>

1734
01:42:18,708 --> 01:42:21,208
<font size="20">Kita tahu jika raut mukanya sudah begitu,</font>

1735
01:42:22,291 --> 01:42:24,750
<font size="20">dia pasti akan bertindak serius.</font>

1736
01:42:26,208 --> 01:42:30,416
<font size="20">Penny tak rela melihat pelakunya lolos.</font>

1737
01:42:31,583 --> 01:42:34,041
<font size="20">Terlalu sering melihat
pelaku kekerasan bebas.</font>

1738
01:42:35,041 --> 01:42:37,458
<font size="20">Aku mengerti, John, tapi tetap saja…</font>

1739
01:42:38,375 --> 01:42:39,833
<font size="20">Itu pembunuhan.</font>

1740
01:42:40,875 --> 01:42:42,916
<font size="20">Kau membunuh Ian Ventham, John.</font>

1741
01:42:44,208 --> 01:42:48,625
<font size="20">Kau sadar jika Ventham menemukan
jasad Mercer, semua bisa terbongkar.</font>

1742
01:42:49,208 --> 01:42:52,375
<font size="20">Maka kau singkirkan Ventham, demi Penny.</font>

1743
01:42:52,458 --> 01:42:53,958
<font size="20">Aku bisa paham.</font>

1744
01:42:57,250 --> 01:43:00,791
<font size="20">Ada suntikan di laci itu, ya, John?
Aku sempat melihatnya.</font>

1745
01:43:11,125 --> 01:43:15,291
<font size="20">Apa isinya, John? Fentanil dosis tinggi?</font>

1746
01:43:15,375 --> 01:43:20,375
<font size="20">Kau pasti tahu cara menyuntikkannya
karena kau dokter hewan.</font>

1747
01:43:30,666 --> 01:43:31,875
<font size="20">Aku mencintai Penny…</font>

1748
01:43:33,250 --> 01:43:34,458
<font size="20">Sangat mencintainya.</font>

1749
01:43:35,583 --> 01:43:37,375
<font size="20">Tapi apa yang kubisa?</font>

1750
01:43:38,416 --> 01:43:40,416
<font size="20">Setiap saat hanya duduk di sini.</font>

1751
01:43:41,166 --> 01:43:43,500
<font size="20">Membacakan buku, menggenggam tangannya.</font>

1752
01:43:44,250 --> 01:43:45,583
<font size="20">Menciumnya sebelum tidur.</font>

1753
01:43:47,000 --> 01:43:48,416
<font size="20">Tapi tak bisa menyembuhkannya.</font>

1754
01:43:50,708 --> 01:43:52,500
<font size="20">Tak bisa memulihkannya.</font>

1755
01:43:55,208 --> 01:43:57,041
<font size="20">Ada satu hal yang aku bisa.</font>

1756
01:43:58,583 --> 01:44:00,000
<font size="20">Melindunginya?</font>

1757
01:44:03,750 --> 01:44:06,500
<font size="20">Tapi bahkan itu pun gagal.</font>

1758
01:44:12,125 --> 01:44:14,333
<font size="20">Kalian pun harus melapor ke polisi.</font>

1759
01:44:16,166 --> 01:44:17,000
<font size="20">Bolehkah…</font>

1760
01:44:18,666 --> 01:44:21,708
<font size="20">Bolehkah aku berdua
bersama Penny sebentar?</font>

1761
01:44:23,375 --> 01:44:26,333
<font size="20">Aku minta sebagai teman.
Sebelum kalian melapor.</font>

1762
01:44:36,875 --> 01:44:37,708
<font size="20">Tentu saja.</font>

1763
01:44:38,958 --> 01:44:41,666
<font size="20">Kami akan keluar
agar kalian bisa berpamitan.</font>

1764
01:44:41,750 --> 01:44:42,583
<font size="20">Bersama-sama.</font>

1765
01:44:44,375 --> 01:44:45,208
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

1766
01:44:50,875 --> 01:44:52,416
<font size="20">Oh, Pen.</font>

1767
01:44:53,541 --> 01:44:54,875
<font size="20">Aku pasti akan merindukanmu.</font>

1768
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:01,625
<font size="20">Mimpi indah, Sayang.</font>

1769
01:45:03,833 --> 01:45:05,458
<font size="20">Pengejaran yang luar biasa.</font>

1770
01:45:20,625 --> 01:45:25,000
<font size="20">Thursday Murder Club berhasil
memecahkan kasus dingin Angela Hughes,</font>

1771
01:45:25,625 --> 01:45:27,041
<font size="20">wanita berpakaian putih.</font>

1772
01:45:30,458 --> 01:45:32,958
<font size="20">Semua misteri akhirnya terjawab.</font>

1773
01:45:34,916 --> 01:45:36,708
<font size="20">Sepadankah dengan lukanya?</font>

1774
01:45:38,166 --> 01:45:39,000
<font size="20">Duka ini?</font>

1775
01:45:41,000 --> 01:45:41,958
<font size="20">Kehilangan ini?</font>

1776
01:45:48,250 --> 01:45:49,750
<font size="20">Kita makhluk cinta.</font>

1777
01:45:50,708 --> 01:45:51,583
<font size="20">Kau dan aku.</font>

1778
01:45:52,208 --> 01:45:53,833
<font size="20">Itu sudah pasti.</font>

1779
01:45:53,916 --> 01:45:57,208
<font size="20">Dari wajah hadirin di sini,
terlihat cinta.</font>

1780
01:45:58,208 --> 01:45:59,916
<font size="20">Cinta seorang ayah pada putranya.</font>

1781
01:46:02,041 --> 01:46:03,875
<font size="20">Cinta seorang ibu pada putrinya.</font>

1782
01:46:06,041 --> 01:46:08,875
<font size="20">Cinta istri pada suami yang dia sayangi.</font>

1783
01:46:09,666 --> 01:46:13,541
<font size="20">Ada pula cinta dari persahabatan
yang tak kalah kuat.</font>

1784
01:46:15,083 --> 01:46:16,208
<font size="20">Persahabatan baru.</font>

1785
01:46:17,000 --> 01:46:18,333
<font size="20">Juga tak terduga.</font>

1786
01:46:18,833 --> 01:46:22,708
<font size="20">Persahabatan yang membuat seseorang,
setelah sekian tahun mencari,</font>

1787
01:46:24,083 --> 01:46:25,791
<font size="20">akhirnya merasa pulang ke rumah.</font>

1788
01:46:26,958 --> 01:46:29,500
<font size="20">Kadang orang baik pun tak luput dari dosa.</font>

1789
01:46:30,083 --> 01:46:32,583
<font size="20">Namun, perbuatan John
semata-mata demi cinta.</font>

1790
01:46:34,333 --> 01:46:35,791
<font size="20">Cintanya pada Penny.</font>

1791
01:46:37,041 --> 01:46:41,166
<font size="20">Kini cinta mereka akan abadi,
merentang ruang dan waktu,</font>

1792
01:46:41,958 --> 01:46:44,125
<font size="20">menari di antara bintang-bintang.</font>

1793
01:46:45,958 --> 01:46:47,083
<font size="20">Mereka akan dirindukan.</font>

1794
01:46:49,708 --> 01:46:51,916
<font size="20">Kenangan mereka akan terus hidup.</font>

1795
01:46:59,875 --> 01:47:00,708
<font size="20">Ibrahim.</font>

1796
01:47:01,750 --> 01:47:03,500
<font size="20">Pidatomu menyentuh sekali.</font>

1797
01:47:04,000 --> 01:47:06,291
<font size="20">Terima kasih sudah menggantikanku.</font>

1798
01:47:06,375 --> 01:47:07,666
<font size="20">Dengan senang hati.</font>

1799
01:47:08,875 --> 01:47:10,916
<font size="20">Kalau aku, pasti akan tercekat.</font>

1800
01:47:12,291 --> 01:47:13,166
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1801
01:47:14,750 --> 01:47:15,958
<font size="20">- Joyce?
- Ya?</font>

1802
01:47:18,708 --> 01:47:20,708
<font size="20">Ini untukmu.</font>

1803
01:47:25,125 --> 01:47:26,208
<font size="20">Tadinya milik Penny.</font>

1804
01:47:27,000 --> 01:47:28,916
<font size="20">Tapi sekarang untukmu.</font>

1805
01:47:35,541 --> 01:47:37,666
<font size="20">Selamat datang di Thursday Murder Club.</font>

1806
01:47:38,250 --> 01:47:39,083
<font size="20">Terima kasih.</font>

1807
01:47:39,166 --> 01:47:41,958
<font size="20">Kami senang kau bergabung secara permanen.</font>

1808
01:47:42,041 --> 01:47:43,125
<font size="20">Ya.</font>

1809
01:47:43,208 --> 01:47:45,333
<font size="20">Tidak sabar beraksi bersama.</font>

1810
01:47:45,416 --> 01:47:47,916
<font size="20">- Jangan lupa aturan BAKU.
- Apa?</font>

1811
01:47:48,500 --> 01:47:50,541
<font size="20">Bawa Kue.</font>

1812
01:47:53,625 --> 01:47:54,625
<font size="20">Joanna, lihat.</font>

1813
01:47:55,291 --> 01:47:57,291
<font size="20">Ibu resmi menjadi anggota.</font>

1814
01:47:58,125 --> 01:47:59,583
<font size="20">Selamat, Bu.</font>

1815
01:48:01,666 --> 01:48:04,833
<font size="20">Masih ingat aku bilang
keliru Ibu tinggal di sini?</font>

1816
01:48:06,083 --> 01:48:07,083
<font size="20">Aku salah.</font>

1817
01:48:07,791 --> 01:48:09,500
<font size="20">Semua ada waktunya salah.</font>

1818
01:48:11,666 --> 01:48:14,125
<font size="20">Akhirnya Ibu tersenyum lagi
sepeninggal Ayah.</font>

1819
01:48:14,958 --> 01:48:16,541
<font size="20">Itu berkat Elizabeth,</font>

1820
